1
00:00:05,005 --> 00:00:07,007
[owl hoots]

2
00:00:13,764 --> 00:00:16,016
[Sanghyun] It was the first time
Junseo wasn't around.

3
00:00:16,683 --> 00:00:17,684
[Junseo] That's crazy.

4
00:00:17,768 --> 00:00:18,769
Really?

5
00:00:18,852 --> 00:00:19,895
[Sanghyun] I made it.

6
00:00:23,941 --> 00:00:25,067
It felt pretty lonely.

7
00:00:25,150 --> 00:00:26,568
SANGHYUN'S ALONE WITH EVERYONE GONE

8
00:00:26,652 --> 00:00:28,654
Ddolddol's gone. Junseo's gone.

9
00:00:28,737 --> 00:00:31,657
Everyone on my floor left all at once.

10
00:00:33,033 --> 00:00:36,954
There used to be
a bunch of people to hang out with.

11
00:00:41,625 --> 00:00:44,545
JIMIN IS ALSO LEFT ALONE
IN THE WOMEN'S DORM

12
00:00:44,628 --> 00:00:49,967
Sitting there alone, it felt really weird.

13
00:00:51,343 --> 00:00:52,427
[sighs wearily]

14
00:00:53,178 --> 00:00:56,598
This place used to be bustling.
But now that it's empty, it feels strange.

15
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:59,268
-We were together all the time.
-[Dail] Yes.

16
00:00:59,351 --> 00:01:02,604
I never want to come back here,
but I think I'll always remember

17
00:01:02,688 --> 00:01:05,732
the time I spent here
with all those people.

18
00:01:05,816 --> 00:01:07,192
-It's been tough.
-Yeah.

19
00:01:09,027 --> 00:01:12,489
[Jaegyun] I met some really great people
and made so many amazing memories.

20
00:01:13,490 --> 00:01:15,492
[Dail] But at the same time,

21
00:01:15,576 --> 00:01:20,038
it was hard for me to laugh
and joke around with the other finalists

22
00:01:20,122 --> 00:01:21,415
like I used to before.

23
00:01:22,124 --> 00:01:25,002
Still, I'm going to
give it my all tomorrow.

24
00:01:25,711 --> 00:01:28,755
I want to win at the very end,
which is natural.

25
00:01:28,839 --> 00:01:31,592
-We have to do our best.
-[Horseking] Of course, and I always have.

26
00:01:31,675 --> 00:01:33,760
You have to just put your feelings aside

27
00:01:34,636 --> 00:01:37,014
and focus on what's best for you.

28
00:01:37,598 --> 00:01:39,725
I want to get
that competitive feeling back.

29
00:01:40,267 --> 00:01:44,229
Rather than trying to enjoy it,
I want to play as aggressively as I can.

30
00:01:44,313 --> 00:01:45,314
For me...

31
00:01:46,940 --> 00:01:49,818
honestly, I came here to win.

32
00:01:49,901 --> 00:01:53,947
I'm going to give it everything I've got
and do whatever it takes to win.

33
00:01:54,031 --> 00:01:56,992
Now that I've come
all this way to the finals,

34
00:01:58,493 --> 00:02:00,287
I have to win.

35
00:02:00,871 --> 00:02:03,248
My desire to win has become huge.

36
00:02:03,332 --> 00:02:04,541
Let's go.

37
00:02:05,375 --> 00:02:08,211
Gosh, I'm so sleepy. Good work, everyone.

38
00:02:08,795 --> 00:02:11,298
[Horseking] I wonder
what game we'll play tomorrow.

39
00:02:13,717 --> 00:02:16,511
[♪ ominous music playing]

40
00:02:32,694 --> 00:02:36,198
[Jimin] From the moment I walked in here,
my goal was to win.

41
00:02:36,823 --> 00:02:39,451
PARK JIMIN
PHYSICAL: 40, BRAINS: 80, POLITICS: 90

42
00:02:39,534 --> 00:02:42,204
[Dail] If I've made it this far,
there's only one thing left to do.

43
00:02:43,664 --> 00:02:47,542
Take everyone out and leave as the winner.

44
00:02:47,626 --> 00:02:49,878
YANG DAIL
PHYSICAL: 80, BRAINS: 70, POLITICS 70

45
00:02:50,462 --> 00:02:52,881
[Jaegyun] After enduring so much
to make it to the finals,

46
00:02:53,674 --> 00:02:55,592
I only had one goal.

47
00:02:56,843 --> 00:02:57,886
I just wanted to win.

48
00:02:57,969 --> 00:03:00,472
HWANG JAEGYUN
PHYSICAL: 90, BRAINS: 80, POLITICS 50

49
00:03:01,473 --> 00:03:04,309
[Sanghyun] I don't want to leave
with any regrets. If I don't win,

50
00:03:06,103 --> 00:03:07,396
then it's pointless.

51
00:03:07,479 --> 00:03:09,481
YOUN SANGHYUN
PHYSICAL: 80, BRAINS: 90, POLITICS 60

52
00:03:10,482 --> 00:03:13,276
[Horseking] I'm going to make these finals
a true finals,

53
00:03:14,194 --> 00:03:15,570
the Horseking way.

54
00:03:16,988 --> 00:03:20,283
I'm taking win, no matter what.
I've made up my mind.

55
00:03:20,367 --> 00:03:22,828
HORSEKING
PHYSICAL: 90, BRAINS: 70, POLITICS 50

56
00:03:22,911 --> 00:03:26,790
[host]
The winner of Deadly Tag will receive

57
00:03:26,873 --> 00:03:30,419
a grand prize of 100 million won.

58
00:03:42,389 --> 00:03:44,266
[Jimin exclaims] This place is really big.

59
00:03:44,891 --> 00:03:47,185
-[gasps]
-They really went all out with this.

60
00:03:47,269 --> 00:03:49,062
Does it stretch all the way to that end?

61
00:03:52,065 --> 00:03:53,817
[Jimin] Gosh, it's so huge.

62
00:03:53,900 --> 00:03:56,153
[Jaegyun] Hiding is going to be harder
than I thought.

63
00:03:57,946 --> 00:04:00,115
[Dail]
The finals really are on another level.

64
00:04:00,198 --> 00:04:03,201
And since it's the finals,
it's going to be insanely tough.

65
00:04:05,036 --> 00:04:08,165
[Sanghyun] This won't be easy.
I'll have to come up with a good strategy.

66
00:04:09,791 --> 00:04:13,086
[Jimin] The chase area was wider
than I expected. It was very big.

67
00:04:13,170 --> 00:04:17,257
So, I just kept looking around
for places to hide.

68
00:04:18,258 --> 00:04:21,470
[Jaegyun] If we hide in those containers,
it'll just be like hide-and-seek.

69
00:04:21,553 --> 00:04:23,263
[Horseking] Exactly. Hide-and-seek.

70
00:04:25,724 --> 00:04:28,018
DEADLY TAG

71
00:04:28,101 --> 00:04:29,269
[♪ thrilling music playing]

72
00:04:29,352 --> 00:04:32,689
[host]
To the five players who have advanced

73
00:04:33,356 --> 00:04:35,525
to the final match of Deadly Tag,

74
00:04:36,943 --> 00:04:37,944
welcome.

75
00:04:40,363 --> 00:04:44,743
We will now begin
the final match of Deadly Tag.

76
00:04:48,747 --> 00:04:52,250
The final match of Deadly Tag...

77
00:04:59,549 --> 00:05:01,676
is "Tag."

78
00:05:02,219 --> 00:05:03,637
[Dail exclaims]

79
00:05:04,346 --> 00:05:07,724
It's tag. The most basic form of the game.

80
00:05:07,808 --> 00:05:10,936
Run, tag, and survive.

81
00:05:11,478 --> 00:05:16,316
[Jaegyun] The classic tag
is just a perfect fit for Deadly Tag.

82
00:05:16,399 --> 00:05:21,571
"Tag." Even its name
is really befitting of the finals.

83
00:05:24,157 --> 00:05:26,618
I think I hate the Seeker now.

84
00:05:26,701 --> 00:05:32,207
[host] "Tag" is a simple game
where one becomes the Seeker

85
00:05:32,290 --> 00:05:36,002
to remain untagged
for as long as possible.

86
00:05:36,086 --> 00:05:37,838
In the end, it's a game of tag,

87
00:05:37,921 --> 00:05:40,674
so I realized physical ability
would be key.

88
00:05:40,757 --> 00:05:43,343
[Horseking]
My adrenaline was pumping like crazy.

89
00:05:43,426 --> 00:05:45,011
[Jaegyun] I was so nervous.

90
00:05:46,137 --> 00:05:47,138
TAG RULES

91
00:05:47,222 --> 00:05:49,516
[host] Of the five players,
one will be the Seeker,

92
00:05:49,599 --> 00:05:52,519
while the other four
will be regular players.

93
00:05:52,602 --> 00:05:56,273
The player who currently holds
the Seeker role

94
00:05:57,023 --> 00:05:58,942
will start the game as the first Seeker.

95
00:05:59,025 --> 00:06:00,652
JAEGYUN REACHED THE FINALS AS THE SEEKER

96
00:06:00,735 --> 00:06:03,613
It's going to be a lot of running
right from the start.

97
00:06:03,697 --> 00:06:05,740
Out of everyone who made it to the finals,

98
00:06:05,824 --> 00:06:08,785
I was the most confident in my stamina.

99
00:06:08,869 --> 00:06:12,789
[host]
Each player has 20 minutes on their clock.

100
00:06:13,498 --> 00:06:14,749
When the game begins,

101
00:06:14,833 --> 00:06:17,419
the regular players' clocks
will be frozen,

102
00:06:17,502 --> 00:06:20,964
and only the Seeker's clock
will count down.

103
00:06:22,507 --> 00:06:25,510
Regular players can tag the Seeker.

104
00:06:25,594 --> 00:06:27,470
Once the Seeker is tagged,

105
00:06:27,554 --> 00:06:31,391
they lose the Seeker role
and become a regular player.

106
00:06:32,183 --> 00:06:35,562
When this happens,
their countdown will stop immediately.

107
00:06:36,271 --> 00:06:39,774
The player who tagged the Seeker
becomes the new Seeker,

108
00:06:39,858 --> 00:06:42,777
and from that moment,
their clock will begin counting down.

109
00:06:45,739 --> 00:06:50,410
When the Seeker's time runs out
and reaches zero,

110
00:06:50,493 --> 00:06:52,120
they will become a Challenger.

111
00:06:52,203 --> 00:06:56,750
The Challenger then earns the right
to escape the chase area.

112
00:06:57,959 --> 00:06:59,794
LOOKING AROUND

113
00:06:59,878 --> 00:07:04,090
There are a total of five exits
found throughout the chase area.

114
00:07:04,799 --> 00:07:07,552
A Challenger must find
their corresponding exit

115
00:07:07,636 --> 00:07:09,971
and tag its evacuation device.

116
00:07:11,389 --> 00:07:14,934
Ten seconds after it is tagged,
the exit will open.

117
00:07:15,769 --> 00:07:17,604
Once they open the door,
go through the exit,

118
00:07:18,396 --> 00:07:22,108
and board the lift inside,
they win the game.

119
00:07:23,610 --> 00:07:25,320
[exclaims]

120
00:07:25,403 --> 00:07:28,990
[host] Also, during the chase,

121
00:07:29,074 --> 00:07:31,951
all players can purchase abilities
in the Dealer Room.

122
00:07:32,535 --> 00:07:33,953
The available abilities are

123
00:07:34,037 --> 00:07:40,126
Attack, Thief, Stealth,
Quick Revive, Gamble, and Loot.

124
00:07:40,210 --> 00:07:45,465
However, your remaining time will increase
by the cost of the ability you purchase.

125
00:07:47,092 --> 00:07:50,387
Each ability can be held
by only one player at a time.

126
00:07:51,346 --> 00:07:55,266
If a player purchases an ability
that another player already has,

127
00:07:55,350 --> 00:07:57,310
the player who first held it

128
00:07:58,269 --> 00:07:59,896
will lose that ability.

129
00:08:01,398 --> 00:08:05,944
Each time an ability is resold,
its price will increase.

130
00:08:08,196 --> 00:08:10,824
If a player's personal time
exceeds 40 minutes,

131
00:08:12,951 --> 00:08:16,121
they are immediately eliminated
from the game.

132
00:08:17,080 --> 00:08:18,957
Five minutes is a lot of time.

133
00:08:19,708 --> 00:08:22,502
I don't think it'll be hard
to find people in this area.

134
00:08:23,169 --> 00:08:25,755
[Horseking] The Seeker role
will be constantly passed around

135
00:08:25,839 --> 00:08:28,425
as each player has 20 minutes
they need to count down.

136
00:08:28,508 --> 00:08:31,302
With five finalists,
that's 100 minutes in total.

137
00:08:31,386 --> 00:08:33,972
There are abilities and all,
but I don't care about that.

138
00:08:34,055 --> 00:08:37,851
I thought I needed to run
as much as I could. I locked in.

139
00:08:37,934 --> 00:08:40,895
[host] In the finals, the tagging method
will be different.

140
00:08:42,230 --> 00:08:45,066
The rules are the same,
but for faster changes,

141
00:08:45,150 --> 00:08:49,070
tags will be registered through
electronic devices worn on the hand.

142
00:08:49,821 --> 00:08:53,491
Reach out and touch
another player's back to register the tag.

143
00:08:53,575 --> 00:08:56,828
The result will be shown
with a light on the player's right arm.

144
00:08:57,662 --> 00:08:59,873
A successful tag lights up red,

145
00:08:59,956 --> 00:09:02,834
while the player who was tagged
lights up yellow.

146
00:09:02,917 --> 00:09:06,421
While yellow,
the player cannot move from their spot

147
00:09:07,172 --> 00:09:08,923
or tag anyone for one minute.

148
00:09:09,674 --> 00:09:12,510
"Tag" will be played over three rounds.

149
00:09:13,053 --> 00:09:15,013
Rounds 1 and 2 will end after 12 tags,

150
00:09:15,096 --> 00:09:19,476
while Round 3 will end after 20 tags.

151
00:09:20,727 --> 00:09:25,982
Also, if there is no winner after Round 3,
the End Rule will be triggered.

152
00:09:27,317 --> 00:09:30,487
[Sanghyun] It was basically a test
of stamina, I was confident.

153
00:09:32,072 --> 00:09:36,117
Honestly, the two most important
things you needed in every game

154
00:09:36,201 --> 00:09:38,661
were stamina and mental strength.

155
00:09:38,745 --> 00:09:43,041
So I told myself,
"Hang in there. Stay strong."

156
00:09:43,583 --> 00:09:46,461
When you're given a chance
to be the last one standing,

157
00:09:46,544 --> 00:09:48,838
it gives you this extra bit of courage.

158
00:09:49,589 --> 00:09:52,842
I really want to be
the winner of Deadly Tag.

159
00:09:53,676 --> 00:09:58,306
[Jaegyun] I was going to be the first one
to start as the Seeker.

160
00:09:58,932 --> 00:10:01,142
I'm confident I can avoid getting tagged.

161
00:10:01,226 --> 00:10:04,687
I'm determined to give it
everything I have and win this thing.

162
00:10:04,771 --> 00:10:06,731
DEADLY TAG

163
00:10:07,524 --> 00:10:11,945
[host] The final match
of Deadly Tag will begin now.

164
00:10:17,158 --> 00:10:20,120
"TAG" STARTS

165
00:10:20,203 --> 00:10:23,665
From this moment,
all players will be given 20 minutes.

166
00:10:23,748 --> 00:10:25,375
"TAG"
SEEKER: HWANG JAEGYUN

167
00:10:25,959 --> 00:10:29,170
The first Seeker is Hwang Jaegyun.

168
00:10:29,254 --> 00:10:31,131
Please depart immediately.

169
00:10:32,757 --> 00:10:34,008
[Jimin exclaims]

170
00:10:34,968 --> 00:10:36,594
[Jimin] This is crazy.

171
00:10:37,929 --> 00:10:42,142
[host] As Seeker, Hwang Jaegyun's time
will begin counting down in three minutes.

172
00:10:42,225 --> 00:10:44,185
[♪ intense music playing]

173
00:10:44,269 --> 00:10:46,271
[Jaegyun]
This is definitely a test of stamina.

174
00:10:48,648 --> 00:10:51,025
I'm going to run like crazy
until the very end.

175
00:10:54,445 --> 00:10:57,490
How about we all try our best
to catch Jaegyun together at first?

176
00:10:57,574 --> 00:10:58,992
-With you?
-Of course!

177
00:10:59,576 --> 00:11:02,245
[Sanghyun] I bet Jaegyun will be too big
to hide anywhere.

178
00:11:02,871 --> 00:11:04,914
Is there even time to hide?

179
00:11:04,998 --> 00:11:06,875
-Exactly, that's actually the problem.
-Right?

180
00:11:07,834 --> 00:11:09,043
[Jimin sighs]

181
00:11:09,669 --> 00:11:12,630
[Horseking] Even if they hide,
I can hunt down every single one of them.

182
00:11:12,714 --> 00:11:17,010
Especially when it comes to running,
speed is my strength.

183
00:11:17,093 --> 00:11:20,263
I'm not afraid to lay it
all on the line when running away.

184
00:11:20,346 --> 00:11:21,890
I'm totally,

185
00:11:21,973 --> 00:11:23,266
completely,

186
00:11:23,349 --> 00:11:25,059
absolutely confident.

187
00:11:30,190 --> 00:11:32,775
JAEGYUN IS WARMING UP AND NOT EVEN HIDING

188
00:11:36,404 --> 00:11:39,324
[Jaegyun] They said the Seeker's location
is shown as soon as the game starts.

189
00:11:39,407 --> 00:11:40,783
So, my first plan

190
00:11:40,867 --> 00:11:44,120
was to be under the column
that leads up to the second floor.

191
00:11:44,204 --> 00:11:46,206
Then, when my location is revealed,

192
00:11:46,289 --> 00:11:49,250
the others will start looking for me,

193
00:11:49,334 --> 00:11:51,002
and they'll search the first floor first.

194
00:11:51,085 --> 00:11:54,422
So, I plan to go
onto the second floor catwalk

195
00:11:54,505 --> 00:11:57,508
and burn as much time as possible.

196
00:11:57,592 --> 00:12:01,387
Even if they spot me then,
it'll take them a while to get up there.

197
00:12:01,471 --> 00:12:04,015
So, even if I'm the first person
to get tagged,

198
00:12:04,098 --> 00:12:07,018
I feel like I can spend
at least five minutes there.

199
00:12:09,854 --> 00:12:12,899
I think I can pull this off
by running around and dodging.

200
00:12:14,776 --> 00:12:17,820
[alarm blaring]

201
00:12:17,904 --> 00:12:20,573
[host]
The final match's chase will begin now.

202
00:12:21,407 --> 00:12:23,952
The Seeker is currently at C5.

203
00:12:24,535 --> 00:12:26,037
[Horseking and Jimin] C5!

204
00:12:37,966 --> 00:12:40,593
That says "two."
"Three, four, five," so it's over there.

205
00:12:42,345 --> 00:12:43,429
C4.

206
00:12:44,889 --> 00:12:48,142
ALL THE PLAYERS SEARCH ON THE 1ST FLOOR

207
00:12:50,395 --> 00:12:54,941
AFTER ASSESSING SITUATION,
HE MAKES HIS MOVE

208
00:12:55,024 --> 00:12:57,026
[♪ intense music playing]

209
00:13:09,706 --> 00:13:10,748
Where is he?

210
00:13:22,677 --> 00:13:28,016
APPROACHES THE CATWALK STAIRS
WHILE AVOIDING THE OTHER PLAYERS

211
00:13:37,191 --> 00:13:38,818
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

212
00:13:44,282 --> 00:13:47,618
C4. C5 is here.

213
00:13:56,836 --> 00:13:58,171
[Jimin] I think he's over there.

214
00:14:23,863 --> 00:14:25,531
Is everyone looking for him?

215
00:14:28,117 --> 00:14:29,118
C...

216
00:14:31,287 --> 00:14:32,288
Where did he hide?

217
00:14:34,874 --> 00:14:35,875
This is B5.

218
00:14:44,467 --> 00:14:45,802
He hid so well.

219
00:14:48,262 --> 00:14:50,431
[Sanghyun]
I couldn't see Jaegyun anywhere.

220
00:14:50,515 --> 00:14:53,810
I thought, "If I were the Seeker,
where would I hide?"

221
00:14:53,893 --> 00:14:55,561
And the stairs were right in front of me.

222
00:14:56,229 --> 00:14:57,271
They announce your location,

223
00:14:57,355 --> 00:14:59,732
so if it were me,
I'd go up to the second floor

224
00:14:59,816 --> 00:15:01,275
and go somewhere else right away.

225
00:15:02,110 --> 00:15:03,861
I had to take a look from above.

226
00:15:10,535 --> 00:15:11,869
So, I went up to the second floor,

227
00:15:11,953 --> 00:15:14,539
and there was Jaegyun crawling
on the bottom like this.

228
00:15:17,625 --> 00:15:18,709
He's here! Here! Second floor!

229
00:15:18,793 --> 00:15:20,211
-[Horseking] Got it!
-Second floor!

230
00:15:20,294 --> 00:15:21,295
[Horseking] Got it!

231
00:15:24,132 --> 00:15:27,135
FOUND AFTER HOLDING OUT FOR 3 MINUTES

232
00:15:39,230 --> 00:15:41,691
[Sanghyun] He's going down.
Dail, over there! Block his path.

233
00:15:43,484 --> 00:15:45,778
SECOND FLOOR EXIT IS BLOCKED

234
00:16:08,301 --> 00:16:09,468
[Jaegyun pants]

235
00:16:12,847 --> 00:16:14,599
DEAD END

236
00:16:22,857 --> 00:16:23,900
Okay.

237
00:16:23,983 --> 00:16:25,860
YOUN SANGHYUN TAGS HWANG JAEGYUN

238
00:16:25,943 --> 00:16:27,111
[host] The Seeker has changed.

239
00:16:27,195 --> 00:16:28,571
RED SEEKER LIGHT IS NOW ON SANGHYUN

240
00:16:28,654 --> 00:16:31,449
The Seeker is currently
in front of the Dealer Room.

241
00:16:32,658 --> 00:16:35,995
TAGGED PLAYERS CANNOT MOVE
OR TAG FOR 1 MINUTE

242
00:16:36,495 --> 00:16:39,123
[Jaegyun] Sadly, I got tagged.
Then, I looked at the scoreboard.

243
00:16:39,207 --> 00:16:41,292
I'd managed to hold out for five minutes.

244
00:16:41,375 --> 00:16:43,628
So, the catwalk strategy
worked out perfectly.

245
00:16:43,711 --> 00:16:45,963
I was pretty satisfied with that.

246
00:16:46,505 --> 00:16:48,883
[panting]

247
00:16:48,966 --> 00:16:51,636
[Sanghyun] I just ran straight at Jaegyun
and managed to tag him.

248
00:16:51,719 --> 00:16:53,054
Then, I became the Seeker,

249
00:16:53,137 --> 00:16:56,349
and suddenly, everyone started
to look at me differently.

250
00:16:56,432 --> 00:16:58,476
They were looking at me like I was prey.

251
00:17:00,019 --> 00:17:01,938
[heavy breathing]

252
00:17:02,021 --> 00:17:03,439
[Dail] Come on, let's make it quick.

253
00:17:15,785 --> 00:17:17,578
[Horseking] Sanghyun! Second floor!

254
00:17:20,706 --> 00:17:21,749
[Dail] Fuck.

255
00:17:23,459 --> 00:17:25,670
[Sanghyun] I got past Dail,
thinking, "Now I'm safe."

256
00:17:25,753 --> 00:17:27,004
Then, Jaegyun suddenly showed up.

257
00:17:27,546 --> 00:17:29,507
JAEGYUN APPEARS AS HIS COOLDOWN ENDS

258
00:17:29,590 --> 00:17:31,509
-[Sanghyun screams]
-[Jaegyun laughs]

259
00:17:31,592 --> 00:17:33,219
-No!
-Hey.

260
00:17:33,302 --> 00:17:34,303
Hey.

261
00:17:34,887 --> 00:17:36,806
[host] The Seeker has changed.

262
00:17:38,849 --> 00:17:41,644
[Jaegyun]
In "Tag," unlike the previous games,

263
00:17:41,727 --> 00:17:43,479
you don't stop after making a tag.

264
00:17:43,563 --> 00:17:46,190
You have to run away
immediately after a tag,

265
00:17:46,274 --> 00:17:48,234
so it was really physically exhausting.

266
00:17:49,360 --> 00:17:51,153
[Horseking] Block the right side
at the stairs.

267
00:17:51,237 --> 00:17:53,406
-Sorry?
-After the minute, block the right side.

268
00:18:04,041 --> 00:18:05,251
[Jaegyun sighs] This is exhausting.

269
00:18:05,334 --> 00:18:06,669
YANG DAIL TAGS HWANG JAEGYUN

270
00:18:06,752 --> 00:18:08,087
[host] The Seeker has changed.

271
00:18:08,838 --> 00:18:09,839
[Horseking] He's over here!

272
00:18:10,339 --> 00:18:11,882
[Dail] As soon as I became the Seeker,

273
00:18:11,966 --> 00:18:16,345
everyone started chasing me like crazy,
so I just ran for my life.

274
00:18:18,806 --> 00:18:19,807
[Dail sighs]

275
00:18:19,890 --> 00:18:21,642
[host] The Seeker has changed.

276
00:18:21,726 --> 00:18:23,436
Oh! It changed.

277
00:18:23,519 --> 00:18:26,439
[Jimin] The Seeker kept changing so fast.

278
00:18:28,566 --> 00:18:30,401
-[Horseking] Here you are!
-[both screaming]

279
00:18:30,484 --> 00:18:32,153
-[Jaegyun] Hey!
-[Horseking] Jaegyun!

280
00:18:32,236 --> 00:18:33,988
The other stairs! The other side!

281
00:18:34,947 --> 00:18:36,407
Man, this guy's crazy!

282
00:18:36,490 --> 00:18:37,867
Hey, go up the stairs!

283
00:18:40,995 --> 00:18:42,204
Aha!

284
00:18:43,205 --> 00:18:46,417
DAIL QUICKLY COMES UP
THE STAIRS ON OTHER SIDE

285
00:18:49,253 --> 00:18:51,047
[host] The Seeker has changed.

286
00:18:51,130 --> 00:18:52,340
[Dail laughs]

287
00:18:52,423 --> 00:18:53,674
Hey.

288
00:18:53,758 --> 00:18:55,635
[host] The Seeker has changed.

289
00:18:57,845 --> 00:19:00,056
[Sanghyun panting heavily]

290
00:19:00,139 --> 00:19:01,140
[Dail] God damn, I'm dying!

291
00:19:02,099 --> 00:19:05,770
Running nonstop like this
without a break is exhausting.

292
00:19:05,853 --> 00:19:08,147
This final match is seriously no joke.

293
00:19:08,230 --> 00:19:12,193
[Sanghyun] Jimin! Hey, Jimin!

294
00:19:13,361 --> 00:19:14,570
[Jimin] Gosh, they run so damn well.

295
00:19:15,988 --> 00:19:17,031
Jimin!

296
00:19:20,785 --> 00:19:22,703
[host] The Seeker has changed.

297
00:19:23,371 --> 00:19:24,413
[Horseking] Hey!

298
00:19:26,207 --> 00:19:27,750
[Sanghyun] Sorry, sorry.

299
00:19:28,501 --> 00:19:29,752
[Jimin groans]

300
00:19:29,835 --> 00:19:30,878
You bastard!

301
00:19:30,961 --> 00:19:33,047
[host] The Seeker has changed.

302
00:19:33,130 --> 00:19:35,591
[host] The Seeker is currently at B3.

303
00:19:35,675 --> 00:19:37,510
Over there.

304
00:19:37,593 --> 00:19:38,761
-We have to go down.
-[Jaegyun] Okay.

305
00:20:00,366 --> 00:20:01,367
Where is he?

306
00:20:06,455 --> 00:20:08,666
[Jaegyun] I happened to glance
at the window beside me,

307
00:20:10,167 --> 00:20:12,712
and I saw Sanghyun hiding
inside a container.

308
00:20:12,795 --> 00:20:15,089
[♪ interesting music playing]

309
00:20:15,172 --> 00:20:16,215
Where is he?

310
00:20:16,298 --> 00:20:18,259
I pretended I couldn't find him
and walked past

311
00:20:22,346 --> 00:20:23,639
HWANG JAEGYUN TAGS YOUN SANGHYUN

312
00:20:23,723 --> 00:20:25,224
then slipped inside and tagged him.

313
00:20:26,183 --> 00:20:27,852
[host] The Seeker has changed.

314
00:20:28,477 --> 00:20:31,313
The Seeker is currently at B6.

315
00:20:31,397 --> 00:20:32,398
[Jaegyun] Okay.

316
00:20:33,733 --> 00:20:35,067
[exclaims]

317
00:20:38,320 --> 00:20:39,321
Come on out.

318
00:20:40,448 --> 00:20:41,949
Horseking, I'm exhausted.

319
00:20:42,032 --> 00:20:44,827
[Horseking]
I didn't mind not getting a break.

320
00:20:45,745 --> 00:20:47,246
I was confident in my stamina,

321
00:20:47,747 --> 00:20:50,040
so whenever I saw the Seeker,
I'd be like a mad dog,

322
00:20:50,124 --> 00:20:51,834
and I chased them relentlessly.

323
00:20:51,917 --> 00:20:53,127
I'm not going to tag you!

324
00:20:54,086 --> 00:20:55,087
Jaegyun!

325
00:20:56,297 --> 00:20:57,548
-Please, Horseking!
-Seriously!

326
00:20:57,631 --> 00:20:59,925
-Let me go one time!
-No, seriously!

327
00:21:00,509 --> 00:21:02,553
-Let me go just once.
-Jaegyun, here I come!

328
00:21:07,308 --> 00:21:08,309
Come on out!

329
00:21:08,893 --> 00:21:09,894
[Jaegyun] Gosh, I'm tired.

330
00:21:09,977 --> 00:21:12,438
JAEGYUN IS WORN OUT
AFTER CONSECUTIVE CHASES

331
00:21:16,650 --> 00:21:17,651
Don't.

332
00:21:17,735 --> 00:21:19,570
HORSEKING TAGS HWANG JAEGYUN

333
00:21:19,653 --> 00:21:21,238
[host] The Seeker has changed.

334
00:21:21,322 --> 00:21:23,365
[Horseking laughs maniacally]

335
00:21:31,624 --> 00:21:32,958
What?

336
00:21:34,418 --> 00:21:35,461
That punk.

337
00:21:37,338 --> 00:21:38,506
Sanghyun's the Seeker!

338
00:21:39,131 --> 00:21:40,508
What?

339
00:21:40,591 --> 00:21:42,009
[Horseking] He used an item.

340
00:21:42,593 --> 00:21:43,594
What?

341
00:21:44,345 --> 00:21:45,721
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

342
00:21:45,805 --> 00:21:48,015
[Jimin] He's hiding after using an item.

343
00:21:48,098 --> 00:21:49,350
[Horseking] He bought the "Thief."

344
00:21:50,100 --> 00:21:51,185
Thief? What does that do?

345
00:21:51,268 --> 00:21:52,686
-What?
-What does Thief do?

346
00:21:52,770 --> 00:21:55,189
If someone tags the Seeker,
he becomes the Seeker.

347
00:21:56,774 --> 00:21:58,234
[Horseking]
Sanghyun stole the Seeker role.

348
00:21:58,776 --> 00:22:01,779
[host] After purchasing
the Thief ability from the Dealer,

349
00:22:02,279 --> 00:22:04,615
if another player tags the Seeker,

350
00:22:04,698 --> 00:22:07,451
the player with the Thief ability
becomes the Seeker instead.

351
00:22:08,536 --> 00:22:10,830
[groans] What really annoyed me was,

352
00:22:10,913 --> 00:22:12,832
the three of us were rounding people up,

353
00:22:12,915 --> 00:22:16,585
shouting, "Get him! Over there!"
and chasing each other around.

354
00:22:16,669 --> 00:22:20,422
But only Sanghyun was hiding
and using the Thief.

355
00:22:23,217 --> 00:22:25,553
We were totally robbed.
I'm going to lose my mind.

356
00:22:26,262 --> 00:22:28,764
[sighs] This is driving me crazy.

357
00:22:29,598 --> 00:22:30,975
Where did he go?

358
00:22:32,434 --> 00:22:33,477
Where is he?

359
00:22:36,272 --> 00:22:37,940
Why isn't his location being shared?

360
00:22:38,023 --> 00:22:40,818
Oh. He must've used an ability
to hide his location.

361
00:22:40,901 --> 00:22:42,194
[Jaegyun] Sanghyun's hiding again.

362
00:22:43,279 --> 00:22:44,613
Let's hurry and find him!

363
00:22:44,697 --> 00:22:47,408
[Horseking] Jaegyun, he's gone!
When did that punk use Stealth?

364
00:22:47,491 --> 00:22:48,534
[Jimin] Where is he?

365
00:22:48,617 --> 00:22:50,661
WITH STEALTH,
THE PLAYER'S LOCATION ISN'T SHARED

366
00:22:50,744 --> 00:22:53,038
[sighs wearily] This is insane.

367
00:22:55,958 --> 00:22:58,544
I should've kept a closer eye on Sanghyun.

368
00:22:59,128 --> 00:23:00,754
THE SEEKER'S TIME IS QUICKLY TICKING AWAY

369
00:23:00,838 --> 00:23:02,381
[Jimin] Are we that bad at finding people?

370
00:23:02,464 --> 00:23:04,174
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

371
00:23:04,967 --> 00:23:06,635
He's a genius at hiding.

372
00:23:09,346 --> 00:23:13,058
Sanghyun was so good at hiding
that we couldn't find him anywhere.

373
00:23:14,393 --> 00:23:15,686
This is driving me nuts.

374
00:23:28,365 --> 00:23:31,327
[♪ interesting music playing]

375
00:23:31,410 --> 00:23:34,663
A PHONE SCREEN SHINES
FROM UNDER THE STAIRS

376
00:23:34,747 --> 00:23:36,749
[Sanghyun] Early on, I observed
how the game went along.

377
00:23:36,832 --> 00:23:38,375
Once someone got tagged,

378
00:23:38,459 --> 00:23:40,169
others were tagged immediately.

379
00:23:40,252 --> 00:23:41,754
And they'd tag
the next person right after.

380
00:23:41,837 --> 00:23:43,047
That's how it went.

381
00:23:43,130 --> 00:23:44,965
It'd just end up as a battle of endurance.

382
00:23:45,049 --> 00:23:48,260
So, I thought I should buy the Thief
and hide somewhere.

383
00:23:49,762 --> 00:23:52,473
SANGHYUN HEADS TO THE DEALER ROOM
AFTER LOSING SEEKER ROLE

384
00:23:53,057 --> 00:23:54,516
-I'll take Stealth.
-[dealer] Okay.

385
00:23:54,600 --> 00:23:56,060
STEALTH
LOCATION ISN'T SHARED AS SEEKER

386
00:23:56,143 --> 00:23:57,269
And the Thief.

387
00:23:57,353 --> 00:24:00,356
[dealer] As a result of selecting
the Stealth and Thief abilities,

388
00:24:00,439 --> 00:24:01,732
your time will increase

389
00:24:01,815 --> 00:24:03,317
-by four minutes.
-Okay.

390
00:24:03,901 --> 00:24:05,986
[Sanghyun]
With Stealth, my location wouldn't show.

391
00:24:06,070 --> 00:24:09,031
I used Thief and Stealth
for the best possible combination.

392
00:24:13,619 --> 00:24:16,413
I went and hid under the ramp
in front of the Dealer Room.

393
00:24:16,497 --> 00:24:19,333
It didn't matter
who became the Seeker to me.

394
00:24:19,416 --> 00:24:22,920
If everyone else kept running around,
my plan was to steal the Seeker role

395
00:24:23,003 --> 00:24:26,715
and go into "stealth mode"
while my time runs out.

396
00:24:28,384 --> 00:24:32,054
HORSEKING PASSES BY
SANGHYUN'S HIDING SPOT

397
00:24:39,186 --> 00:24:40,270
[Horseking] He's not here?

398
00:24:46,235 --> 00:24:49,029
JAEGYUN JOINS THE SEARCH
OF THE DEALER ROOM

399
00:24:49,113 --> 00:24:51,448
[Sanghyun]
I kept hearing thumping above me,

400
00:24:51,532 --> 00:24:53,242
and people kept coming and going.

401
00:24:54,618 --> 00:24:57,496
My heart kept pounding like crazy.

402
00:25:00,165 --> 00:25:01,166
He's not here.

403
00:25:01,667 --> 00:25:06,005
He's not here. Where is he hiding?
He's driving me insane.

404
00:25:09,717 --> 00:25:11,677
Where is he? I'm losing my mind.

405
00:25:23,689 --> 00:25:25,357
[sighs] I can't believe him.

406
00:25:27,192 --> 00:25:28,318
[sighs]

407
00:25:54,970 --> 00:25:56,013
He's not here.

408
00:26:00,350 --> 00:26:02,102
There's nowhere to hide though.

409
00:26:06,190 --> 00:26:07,191
[sighs]

410
00:26:07,274 --> 00:26:08,692
Hey, we have to find him quickly.

411
00:26:08,776 --> 00:26:10,402
I have no idea where he is.

412
00:26:12,654 --> 00:26:13,655
This is insane.

413
00:26:13,739 --> 00:26:15,949
SANGHYUN'S TIME HAS DECREASED
BY OVER 10 MINUTES

414
00:26:16,658 --> 00:26:17,743
You didn't see him, Jimin?

415
00:26:18,327 --> 00:26:19,953
-What? No, I haven't.
-No?

416
00:26:20,621 --> 00:26:21,997
What if we never find him?

417
00:26:23,582 --> 00:26:24,792
Dail, you haven't see him?

418
00:26:25,584 --> 00:26:27,211
[sighs] Where on earth is he?

419
00:26:28,295 --> 00:26:29,546
You're dead meat.

420
00:26:30,923 --> 00:26:34,051
When I looked at the
scoreboard, he had lost so much time.

421
00:26:34,134 --> 00:26:38,180
As someone on the losing side,
it was so frustrating and annoying.

422
00:26:40,891 --> 00:26:42,351
God, you are so dead.

423
00:26:45,229 --> 00:26:46,480
I'll take the Attack ability.

424
00:26:46,563 --> 00:26:48,357
[dealer] Mr. Horseking, would you like to

425
00:26:48,440 --> 00:26:49,858
-purchase the Attack ability?
-Yes.

426
00:26:49,942 --> 00:26:51,860
Your time will increase by three minutes.

427
00:26:51,944 --> 00:26:52,986
[Horseking] Okay.

428
00:26:53,946 --> 00:26:59,034
If a player with Attack tags the Seeker,
that Seeker gets five extra minutes.

429
00:26:59,118 --> 00:27:02,162
Since Sanghyun's time was so low,

430
00:27:02,246 --> 00:27:05,582
I thought I'd tag him
and give him back the time he'd lost.

431
00:27:06,375 --> 00:27:08,293
[frustrated sigh]
This is driving me crazy.

432
00:27:10,838 --> 00:27:12,131
You're dead when I see you.

433
00:27:20,180 --> 00:27:22,808
[Sanghyun] As soon as Horseking left,
I came out...

434
00:27:24,184 --> 00:27:25,269
Four minutes?

435
00:27:26,436 --> 00:27:27,563
I'll buy the Attack ability.

436
00:27:28,146 --> 00:27:30,774
-Your time will increase by four minutes.
-Okay.

437
00:27:31,525 --> 00:27:32,776
I stole the Attack ability.

438
00:27:34,027 --> 00:27:36,405
I bought it right back and hid again.

439
00:27:41,326 --> 00:27:43,996
But I made one mistake.

440
00:27:44,079 --> 00:27:46,540
If you find him, tell me first.
I bought Attack.

441
00:27:46,623 --> 00:27:49,835
HORSEKING'S ATTACK ABILITY
HAS BEEN REMOVED

442
00:27:50,419 --> 00:27:52,170
The Attack I bought is gone.

443
00:27:52,254 --> 00:27:53,881
Someone must have bought Attack.

444
00:27:53,964 --> 00:27:55,674
Sanghyun's there again?

445
00:27:57,217 --> 00:27:59,928
[Sanghyun] Everyone found out
I was hiding near the Dealer Room.

446
00:28:02,139 --> 00:28:04,808
SANGHYUN COMES OUT AFTER HEARING HORSEKING

447
00:28:05,726 --> 00:28:08,395
I came out and was looking around
for another place to hide.

448
00:28:10,898 --> 00:28:14,067
He's there! Over there!
At the far end of the second floor!

449
00:28:14,943 --> 00:28:17,863
SANGHYUN IS SPOTTED
AS SOON AS HE COMES OUT

450
00:28:19,489 --> 00:28:25,621
PLAYERS CONVERGE ON THE SECOND FLOOR

451
00:28:26,788 --> 00:28:27,998
[Horseking sighs]

452
00:28:29,041 --> 00:28:30,083
You bastard.

453
00:28:31,501 --> 00:28:35,005
SANGHYUN IS CORNERED
ON THE SECOND FLOOR

454
00:28:40,218 --> 00:28:42,596
PASSES BY

455
00:28:42,679 --> 00:28:43,680
[Sanghyun] Huh?

456
00:28:44,681 --> 00:28:45,682
Hey, over here.

457
00:28:45,766 --> 00:28:47,976
[Horseking] One second.
Let me go buy Attack first.

458
00:28:48,852 --> 00:28:50,354
I'm so mad I can't take it anymore.

459
00:28:52,731 --> 00:28:54,024
I'd like to buy Attack, please.

460
00:28:54,107 --> 00:28:57,653
[dealer] Sure, your current time
will increase by five minutes.

461
00:28:57,736 --> 00:28:58,779
[Horseking] Okay.

462
00:28:59,696 --> 00:29:00,989
[Jaegyun] Horseking, hurry up.

463
00:29:01,073 --> 00:29:04,159
[Sanghyun] Jaegyun was stalling.
I thought, "This is bad."

464
00:29:05,369 --> 00:29:08,080
I thought I absolutely had to
get out of there.

465
00:29:10,624 --> 00:29:12,292
Hey! [sighs]

466
00:29:13,543 --> 00:29:16,254
DAIL BLOCKS THE SECOND FLOOR EXIT

467
00:29:20,300 --> 00:29:21,385
[Sanghyun] What is this?

468
00:29:22,761 --> 00:29:24,513
HORSEKING ATTACKS WHEN HIS GUARD IS DOWN

469
00:29:26,556 --> 00:29:28,725
[host] The Seeker has changed.

470
00:29:28,809 --> 00:29:30,018
"TAG"
SEEKER: HORSEKING

471
00:29:30,102 --> 00:29:33,146
DUE TO ATTACK ABILITY'S EFFECT
SANGHYUN GETS 5 MINUTES ADDED

472
00:29:33,230 --> 00:29:37,484
I'd been hiding for almost 10 minutes,
but I gained five minutes

473
00:29:37,567 --> 00:29:39,277
because Horseking used Attack.

474
00:29:40,362 --> 00:29:41,989
I thought, "What a shame."

475
00:29:42,072 --> 00:29:46,743
[host] There have been 12 total tags.
Round 1 is now over.

476
00:29:46,827 --> 00:29:49,329
Round 2 will begin in five minutes.

477
00:29:49,413 --> 00:29:50,455
I ran so much.

478
00:29:50,539 --> 00:29:51,957
[Jaegyun] I'm so tired.

479
00:29:52,040 --> 00:29:53,583
Is your seven minutes the lowest time?

480
00:29:53,667 --> 00:29:55,794
Yeah, I think it's 7 minutes
and 57 seconds.

481
00:29:56,336 --> 00:29:58,005
-[Horseking] Eight minutes.
-[Jaegyun] Yeah.

482
00:29:58,630 --> 00:30:00,424
[Horseking] We're all
in the 20-minute range.

483
00:30:00,507 --> 00:30:03,218
But we have way too much time left.
This is driving me crazy.

484
00:30:03,301 --> 00:30:05,053
How am I supposed to hide for 20 minutes?

485
00:30:05,137 --> 00:30:08,306
This is bad. There was a
17-minute gap between me and Jaegyun.

486
00:30:08,390 --> 00:30:11,685
That's a huge difference in score.

487
00:30:11,768 --> 00:30:15,022
I'm doomed anyway, so if anyone
buys Attack, I'll buy it right back.

488
00:30:15,522 --> 00:30:17,232
Let's see who goes down first.

489
00:30:17,315 --> 00:30:19,776
I'll raise everyone's times
to 40 minutes and take them out.

490
00:30:19,860 --> 00:30:22,195
But don't you have
the most time right now?

491
00:30:22,738 --> 00:30:24,656
A battle of attrition will only hurt you.

492
00:30:25,240 --> 00:30:27,284
I've got nothing to lose anyway.

493
00:30:27,367 --> 00:30:29,411
You're dead meat now. [laughs]

494
00:30:30,704 --> 00:30:33,582
[Sanghyun] Horseking has Attack,
so he can add another five minutes.

495
00:30:33,665 --> 00:30:35,917
Basically, if I get tagged, I'm out.

496
00:30:36,001 --> 00:30:40,922
I'd get tagged in like two seconds,
so I thought I was doomed.

497
00:30:41,548 --> 00:30:42,841
I'm fucked.

498
00:30:42,924 --> 00:30:45,177
I need to avoid him at all costs
and keep running.

499
00:30:45,635 --> 00:30:48,805
-[mic feedback]
-[host] Round 2 will begin now.

500
00:30:49,598 --> 00:30:51,224
Horseking went this way, right?

501
00:30:52,142 --> 00:30:54,936
[host] The Seeker is currently at B5.

502
00:30:56,354 --> 00:30:57,439
This is it. B5.

503
00:31:12,954 --> 00:31:14,623
[Horseking laughing]

504
00:31:22,756 --> 00:31:24,716
Where's Horseking?

505
00:31:26,426 --> 00:31:27,803
Where is he?

506
00:31:28,762 --> 00:31:29,888
Damn it, where is he?

507
00:31:41,066 --> 00:31:42,109
[whispers] Horseking.

508
00:31:43,318 --> 00:31:44,319
It's Horseking.

509
00:31:44,945 --> 00:31:46,947
"TAG"
SEEKER: HORSEKING

510
00:31:47,030 --> 00:31:50,408
SPOTTED HORSEKING WHILE HE WAS HIDING

511
00:31:51,284 --> 00:31:54,162
YANG DAIL CONFIRMED THE LOCATION

512
00:31:58,041 --> 00:31:59,042
Where is he?

513
00:32:00,794 --> 00:32:01,837
Where?

514
00:32:04,881 --> 00:32:06,675
[host] The Seeker has changed.

515
00:32:07,467 --> 00:32:08,802
[Horseking sighs in exasperation]

516
00:32:08,885 --> 00:32:13,431
The dog's going to be let loose soon!
The dog's coming in a minute! Woof, woof!

517
00:32:14,474 --> 00:32:17,060
[host] The Seeker is currently at D4.

518
00:32:17,769 --> 00:32:20,147
D4? Where's D4?

519
00:32:20,689 --> 00:32:21,773
[Jimin] Is Yang Dail hiding?

520
00:32:23,483 --> 00:32:24,484
D4.

521
00:32:26,486 --> 00:32:27,487
D4...

522
00:32:28,572 --> 00:32:29,573
D4 is here.

523
00:32:32,659 --> 00:32:33,827
Where's Yang Dail?

524
00:32:37,581 --> 00:32:39,749
He's not here? Where is he?

525
00:32:40,292 --> 00:32:44,796
"TAG"
SEEKER: YANG DAIL

526
00:32:44,880 --> 00:32:45,964
Where did he go?

527
00:32:48,175 --> 00:32:51,094
YANG DAIL'S BEEN HIDING ON THE CATWALK

528
00:32:51,720 --> 00:32:52,929
[Dail] I'm so tired I could die.

529
00:32:55,432 --> 00:32:58,476
I was looking for a place to hide,
but there weren't any down below.

530
00:32:58,560 --> 00:33:00,770
I figured I'd try hiding up there instead,

531
00:33:00,854 --> 00:33:02,439
so I hid there.

532
00:33:14,993 --> 00:33:15,994
Dail.

533
00:33:19,206 --> 00:33:20,498
Where is he?

534
00:33:20,582 --> 00:33:21,583
That little punk.

535
00:33:22,292 --> 00:33:23,293
Dail!

536
00:33:24,628 --> 00:33:25,754
Come on, let's play.

537
00:33:28,673 --> 00:33:29,966
Where is he?

538
00:33:31,801 --> 00:33:33,220
But we need to play.

539
00:33:35,263 --> 00:33:36,640
[Jimin] Where is he hiding?

540
00:33:37,849 --> 00:33:39,517
-D4?
-D4. It's here.

541
00:33:42,020 --> 00:33:44,606
[Jaegyun]
I looked everywhere but couldn't find him.

542
00:33:44,689 --> 00:33:47,275
I went up to get a better look from above.

543
00:33:47,901 --> 00:33:50,695
And there was Dail
lying flat on the floor.

544
00:33:53,031 --> 00:33:55,033
Dail, just flip over for a second.

545
00:33:55,909 --> 00:33:57,535
HWANG JAEGYUN TAGS YANG DAIL

546
00:33:58,119 --> 00:33:59,871
[host] The Seeker has changed.

547
00:34:00,872 --> 00:34:02,165
-What the heck?
-[Jimin] What's going on?

548
00:34:04,668 --> 00:34:06,127
It says Youn Sanghyun is the Seeker.

549
00:34:07,462 --> 00:34:10,257
SANGHYUN STEALS THE SEEKER ROLE AGAIN

550
00:34:11,383 --> 00:34:13,093
[sighs in exasperation]

551
00:34:13,802 --> 00:34:15,136
[Jimin] Did he use an item?

552
00:34:17,931 --> 00:34:18,932
What?

553
00:34:22,978 --> 00:34:23,979
[groans]

554
00:34:25,480 --> 00:34:26,982
Sanghyun bought Thief again.

555
00:34:28,024 --> 00:34:29,150
I'm going to kill him.

556
00:34:31,569 --> 00:34:34,072
[dealer] Mr. Youn Sanghyun,
which ability would you like to purchase?

557
00:34:34,155 --> 00:34:35,615
Thief. I'll take Thief, please.

558
00:34:35,699 --> 00:34:37,200
And I'll take Gamble.

559
00:34:37,284 --> 00:34:39,995
[dealer]
You have purchased Thief and Gamble.

560
00:34:41,204 --> 00:34:44,165
[host] The player who purchases
the Gamble ability from the Dealer

561
00:34:44,249 --> 00:34:45,417
becomes the Seeker,

562
00:34:45,500 --> 00:34:48,586
and if they keep their status
for five minutes without being tagged,

563
00:34:48,670 --> 00:34:52,048
they will shed five extra minutes
off of their time.

564
00:34:52,674 --> 00:34:56,428
But if they are tagged
before the five minutes are up,

565
00:34:56,928 --> 00:34:59,389
five minutes will be added
to their time instead.

566
00:35:00,390 --> 00:35:02,809
There's no way
I can pull off Gamble in this area.

567
00:35:02,892 --> 00:35:04,102
That was my thought.

568
00:35:04,185 --> 00:35:07,022
But I just needed to find
a really good hiding spot

569
00:35:07,105 --> 00:35:08,481
I already had Stealth,

570
00:35:08,565 --> 00:35:13,153
so I could use Thief, Stealth,
and Gamble and win with that strategy.

571
00:35:13,236 --> 00:35:15,363
For now, I just wanted to do
everything I could.

572
00:35:15,447 --> 00:35:16,531
Is it my turn?

573
00:35:16,615 --> 00:35:18,325
Please go slow and take your time.

574
00:35:27,542 --> 00:35:29,419
[Horseking]
Sanghyun's really good at this game!

575
00:35:30,795 --> 00:35:32,714
Ugh. Geez.

576
00:35:32,797 --> 00:35:34,758
This really is like hide-and-seek.

577
00:35:34,841 --> 00:35:36,009
Where is he?

578
00:35:36,092 --> 00:35:37,093
Beats me.

579
00:35:37,636 --> 00:35:39,054
[Horseking] He's hiding.

580
00:35:40,180 --> 00:35:41,640
Where on earth did he hide?

581
00:35:45,393 --> 00:35:47,437
[Horseking] We need to get him fast.
I'm going nuts.

582
00:35:47,520 --> 00:35:49,022
Hey, where is he?

583
00:35:49,981 --> 00:35:52,525
[sighs] That little rat's hiding again.

584
00:35:52,609 --> 00:35:56,696
[Dail] The way Sanghyun hides
is incredibly annoying as well.

585
00:35:56,780 --> 00:36:01,493
It's like he's playing this game
just to mess with everyone.

586
00:36:01,576 --> 00:36:05,330
Sure enough,
Sanghyun started hiding again.

587
00:36:06,039 --> 00:36:07,499
He started hiding again.

588
00:36:08,667 --> 00:36:09,959
I can't find him.

589
00:36:11,378 --> 00:36:12,420
Where did he go?

590
00:36:12,504 --> 00:36:14,547
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

591
00:36:14,631 --> 00:36:17,717
5 MINUTES DEDUCTED
SANGHYUN'S GAMBLE PAYS OFF

592
00:36:17,801 --> 00:36:20,136
[Horseking] What? Sanghyun bought Gamble.

593
00:36:20,220 --> 00:36:22,097
[groans] You've got to be kidding me!

594
00:36:22,639 --> 00:36:24,057
[Sanghyun sighs]

595
00:36:26,309 --> 00:36:27,477
Hey, where is he?

596
00:36:28,228 --> 00:36:29,896
JAEGYUN PASSES RIGHT BY SANGHYUN

597
00:36:31,022 --> 00:36:32,565
Where did he go?

598
00:36:33,566 --> 00:36:35,151
Where did Sanghyun go?

599
00:36:35,235 --> 00:36:36,903
[Horseking]
Once he hides, there's no hope.

600
00:36:37,404 --> 00:36:38,571
I don't see him anywhere!

601
00:36:38,655 --> 00:36:40,031
[Jimin] Is he on the second floor?

602
00:36:40,699 --> 00:36:42,283
[Sanghyun whispers] Stay away.

603
00:36:44,994 --> 00:36:46,329
[Jaegyun sighs frustratedly]

604
00:36:46,996 --> 00:36:48,665
Check under those lids one by one.

605
00:36:50,041 --> 00:36:57,006
THE OTHER PLAYERS SEARCH THOROUGHLY

606
00:37:00,760 --> 00:37:01,761
Where is he?

607
00:37:04,681 --> 00:37:06,182
[Sanghyun exhales, sniffles]

608
00:37:14,858 --> 00:37:16,818
-[Dail] Oh!
-[Sanghyun giggles]

609
00:37:17,986 --> 00:37:19,738
[host] The Seeker has changed.

610
00:37:19,821 --> 00:37:20,822
[Sanghyun] I was bummed.

611
00:37:20,905 --> 00:37:24,284
But Gamble worked, and I cut down
my time a lot, so it was okay.

612
00:37:24,367 --> 00:37:26,745
-It changed.
-[host] The Seeker has changed.

613
00:37:26,828 --> 00:37:27,996
The Seeker is currently...

614
00:37:28,079 --> 00:37:29,247
-What?
-...at A3.

615
00:37:32,751 --> 00:37:33,918
Where did Dail go?

616
00:37:41,342 --> 00:37:43,845
There he is!

617
00:37:43,928 --> 00:37:45,972
Dail! [laughs cunningly]

618
00:37:48,183 --> 00:37:49,642
-Dail.
-Tag me.

619
00:37:49,726 --> 00:37:51,394
Tag me. And run away.

620
00:37:51,895 --> 00:37:54,481
[host] The Seeker is currently at A2.

621
00:37:54,564 --> 00:37:55,565
[Horseking] Where is she?

622
00:37:56,191 --> 00:37:57,275
Where?

623
00:38:06,242 --> 00:38:07,285
Come here!

624
00:38:12,415 --> 00:38:13,416
Get over here!

625
00:38:16,002 --> 00:38:17,128
[Horseking laughs]

626
00:38:18,922 --> 00:38:19,923
Come here.

627
00:38:20,006 --> 00:38:21,007
[Jimin] No.

628
00:38:23,092 --> 00:38:25,011
No! [groans]

629
00:38:25,094 --> 00:38:26,137
HORSEKING TAGS JIMIN

630
00:38:26,221 --> 00:38:28,139
[host] The Seeker has changed.

631
00:38:33,228 --> 00:38:34,270
CURRENT SEEKER IS SANGHYUN

632
00:38:34,354 --> 00:38:36,815
That bastard took it!

633
00:38:37,649 --> 00:38:39,192
-He stole it?
-[Horseking] Yes!

634
00:38:39,984 --> 00:38:41,361
Sanghyun took it.

635
00:38:41,444 --> 00:38:42,529
[frustrated sigh]

636
00:38:42,612 --> 00:38:45,406
SANGHYUN USED THIEF AGAIN

637
00:38:45,490 --> 00:38:48,159
[Horseking exclaims]
I was seriously about to lose my mind.

638
00:38:48,243 --> 00:38:52,956
From that point, I was like,
"Just wait until I get my hands on you."

639
00:38:53,039 --> 00:38:56,417
I'll play through the night if I have to.
That's the mindset I had.

640
00:38:56,960 --> 00:38:59,128
Honestly, it was making me pretty angry.

641
00:38:59,754 --> 00:39:02,048
[Jaegyun]
I was running myself into the ground,

642
00:39:02,131 --> 00:39:04,217
chasing people, and tagging Seekers,

643
00:39:04,759 --> 00:39:08,179
while Sanghyun was buying
Thief and Stealth and hiding.

644
00:39:08,263 --> 00:39:11,224
When I'm supposed to be the Seeker,
he would become it instead.

645
00:39:11,307 --> 00:39:13,685
Of course, hiding is part of the game,

646
00:39:13,768 --> 00:39:15,395
so it's just my personal opinion.

647
00:39:15,478 --> 00:39:17,480
Because it's a legitimate strategy
in the game.

648
00:39:17,564 --> 00:39:20,066
But if you've been forced
to always search for people,

649
00:39:20,149 --> 00:39:21,818
you can't help but feel that way.

650
00:39:21,901 --> 00:39:27,282
I think some people
might see it as playing dirty.

651
00:39:27,866 --> 00:39:29,909
But I don't really care.

652
00:39:32,036 --> 00:39:33,204
Youn Sanghyun.

653
00:39:35,748 --> 00:39:37,375
[Sanghyun chuckling] This is insane.

654
00:39:39,419 --> 00:39:40,420
Seriously.

655
00:39:41,629 --> 00:39:43,131
Will you look at how he's playing?

656
00:39:45,967 --> 00:39:49,345
Where the hell did that punk go?
Where did he go?

657
00:39:49,429 --> 00:39:51,598
[Jimin] Ugh. Seriously.

658
00:39:57,228 --> 00:39:58,229
[Sanghyun] Please.

659
00:39:58,313 --> 00:39:59,981
If I pull off one more Gamble,

660
00:40:00,064 --> 00:40:02,859
I could reduce my time by a lot.

661
00:40:02,942 --> 00:40:06,738
So, if I just hold out,
I might actually have a shot at winning.

662
00:40:06,821 --> 00:40:08,573
Hey, we have to find Sanghyun!

663
00:40:19,834 --> 00:40:20,835
I can't believe this guy.

664
00:40:20,919 --> 00:40:22,253
NO ONE NOTICED SANGHYUN'S HIDING SPOT

665
00:40:23,379 --> 00:40:24,380
[Sanghyun] That scared me.

666
00:40:26,049 --> 00:40:27,342
Please.

667
00:40:29,552 --> 00:40:32,263
TIME LEFT UNTIL GAMBLE SUCCEEDS

668
00:40:32,347 --> 00:40:33,389
Where did he go?

669
00:40:34,015 --> 00:40:35,224
[sighs]

670
00:40:37,602 --> 00:40:39,020
[Jaegyun] Gosh, this guy...

671
00:40:39,103 --> 00:40:40,355
[sighs]

672
00:40:41,689 --> 00:40:44,609
TIME LEFT UNTIL GAMBLE SUCCEEDS

673
00:40:47,278 --> 00:40:48,404
[Jaegyun groans]

674
00:40:48,488 --> 00:40:51,449
TIME LEFT UNTIL GAMBLE SUCCEEDS

675
00:40:51,532 --> 00:40:52,951
Horseking, come here!

676
00:40:53,034 --> 00:40:55,286
-Come quickly! He's here!
-[Horseking] You punk!

677
00:40:55,370 --> 00:40:56,663
[Jaegyun laughs]

678
00:40:58,247 --> 00:40:59,248
You used Gamble.

679
00:41:00,166 --> 00:41:01,626
[Horseking] You're unbelievable.

680
00:41:02,126 --> 00:41:03,628
[host] The Seeker has changed.

681
00:41:03,711 --> 00:41:04,712
SANGHYUN'S GAMBLE FAILS

682
00:41:05,588 --> 00:41:08,341
THE FAILED GAMBLE PUSHES
SANGHYUN TO THE 11-MINUTE MARK

683
00:41:09,050 --> 00:41:11,886
[Horseking laughs cunningly]

684
00:41:13,554 --> 00:41:16,349
[host] The Seeker is currently at B5.

685
00:41:16,432 --> 00:41:17,642
DEALER ROOM

686
00:41:18,309 --> 00:41:20,269
[Sanghyun] One more.
I need to do one more.

687
00:41:20,979 --> 00:41:22,689
[Jaegyun] Where did he go?

688
00:41:22,772 --> 00:41:23,982
[laughing]

689
00:41:24,065 --> 00:41:27,193
[Dail] Hey! He's over here!

690
00:41:27,276 --> 00:41:29,988
[Horseking panting]

691
00:41:31,698 --> 00:41:32,699
DAIL TAGS HORSEKING

692
00:41:32,782 --> 00:41:34,617
[host] The Seeker has changed.

693
00:41:34,701 --> 00:41:36,619
[Horseking] Hey, it's slippery over here!

694
00:41:40,415 --> 00:41:41,457
[Jaegyun] This way!

695
00:41:44,293 --> 00:41:45,461
[Dail groans]

696
00:41:46,462 --> 00:41:48,381
[host] The Seeker has changed.

697
00:41:48,464 --> 00:41:50,842
[Horseking laughing]

698
00:41:52,635 --> 00:41:54,512
[host] The Seeker has changed.

699
00:41:55,179 --> 00:42:00,435
There have been 12 total tags.
Round 2 is now over.

700
00:42:00,518 --> 00:42:01,686
[Horseking exclaims loudly]

701
00:42:06,691 --> 00:42:09,569
[Sanghyun]
I had actually injured my leg then.

702
00:42:09,652 --> 00:42:12,405
My calf had cramped up badly,
and I couldn't run at all.

703
00:42:12,947 --> 00:42:14,365
DURING ROUND 2

704
00:42:14,949 --> 00:42:16,951
SANGHYUN WAS LOOKING
FOR A PLACE TO HIDE

705
00:42:23,082 --> 00:42:24,083
I don't fit.

706
00:42:28,004 --> 00:42:29,297
[groans]

707
00:42:30,965 --> 00:42:34,052
HE FELL AND PULLED HIS CALF MUSCLE

708
00:42:34,135 --> 00:42:37,096
[Sanghyun] There was no way I could run.

709
00:42:38,222 --> 00:42:40,850
At that point,
I absolutely had to use Thief

710
00:42:40,933 --> 00:42:42,602
and find somewhere to hide.

711
00:42:42,685 --> 00:42:45,480
And that's when I used Gamble too.

712
00:42:45,563 --> 00:42:49,192
I had no choice but to use that strategy
because I couldn't run.

713
00:42:50,193 --> 00:42:54,322
So the most important thing
was to find a good hiding spot first.

714
00:42:56,032 --> 00:42:59,285
I wanted to hide in a place
where I'd be sure I wouldn't be found.

715
00:43:00,661 --> 00:43:01,996
Have we ever been over here?

716
00:43:02,080 --> 00:43:03,081
CAREFULLY SEARCHES FOR A SPOT

717
00:43:08,795 --> 00:43:11,464
This is it. This is my last chance.

718
00:43:12,465 --> 00:43:16,385
I have to make Thief
and Gamble work to win.

719
00:43:16,969 --> 00:43:18,262
I have to survive.

720
00:43:20,306 --> 00:43:21,891
RANKINGS
1. HWANG JAEGYUN, 7:12

721
00:43:21,974 --> 00:43:24,143
2. YOUN SANGHYUN, 11:52
3. YANG DAIL, 12:40

722
00:43:24,227 --> 00:43:25,812
4. HORSEKING, 18:50
5. PARK JIMIN, 19:20

723
00:43:25,895 --> 00:43:29,357
-[mic feedback]
-[host] Round 3 will begin now.

724
00:43:30,358 --> 00:43:33,152
The current Seeker is Yang Dail.

725
00:43:33,236 --> 00:43:35,446
Yang Dail, you may start.

726
00:43:35,530 --> 00:43:38,116
[♪ exhilarating music playing]

727
00:43:38,199 --> 00:43:39,492
Will his location be shared?

728
00:43:39,575 --> 00:43:40,868
Yeah, his can be shared.

729
00:43:40,952 --> 00:43:44,163
-[alarm blaring]
-Where is he?

730
00:43:44,247 --> 00:43:46,666
[host] All players, you may start.

731
00:43:46,749 --> 00:43:50,002
-His location?
-[host] The Seeker is currently at B3.

732
00:43:52,672 --> 00:43:53,714
B3 is here.

733
00:43:53,798 --> 00:43:55,424
B3. Right here!

734
00:44:03,683 --> 00:44:05,351
You punk. Come on out.

735
00:44:05,434 --> 00:44:07,395
[Dail sighs frustratedly]

736
00:44:07,478 --> 00:44:12,108
[Dail] I thought I'd found a good hiding
spot, but I guess I wasn't that lucky.

737
00:44:13,151 --> 00:44:14,277
I have to tag you.

738
00:44:14,777 --> 00:44:16,320
[host] The Seeker has changed.

739
00:44:16,404 --> 00:44:18,865
[Horseking] My goodness! Run!

740
00:44:19,907 --> 00:44:21,951
-[Jaegyun] Horseking, just once.
-No!

741
00:44:22,034 --> 00:44:23,161
-Just once.
-Seriously, no.

742
00:44:23,244 --> 00:44:26,205
[host] The Seeker is currently at C5.

743
00:44:28,332 --> 00:44:29,417
[Horseking] No, no.

744
00:44:30,626 --> 00:44:31,794
[Horseking] Seriously, Jaegyun. No.

745
00:44:31,878 --> 00:44:33,004
No!

746
00:44:33,087 --> 00:44:34,255
[screams]

747
00:44:36,549 --> 00:44:37,592
Ah!

748
00:44:37,675 --> 00:44:39,510
No! Stop chasing me!

749
00:44:40,303 --> 00:44:41,304
I'm almost there.

750
00:44:45,516 --> 00:44:46,934
[screams]

751
00:44:51,522 --> 00:44:52,523
No!

752
00:44:52,607 --> 00:44:54,192
HWANG JAEGYUN TAGS HORSEKING

753
00:44:54,275 --> 00:44:56,194
[host] The Seeker has changed.

754
00:44:58,404 --> 00:44:59,739
[Horseking screams]

755
00:44:59,822 --> 00:45:01,073
He's gone.

756
00:45:01,157 --> 00:45:02,700
He's gone now.

757
00:45:02,783 --> 00:45:05,161
-[Dail] It's 15 minutes now.
-[groans].

758
00:45:05,244 --> 00:45:06,871
[Horseking] That was so close.

759
00:45:07,371 --> 00:45:08,372
[Dail] What the heck?

760
00:45:08,873 --> 00:45:11,250
Sanghyun used Thief again. [sighs]

761
00:45:12,752 --> 00:45:14,587
He's really playing this game like...

762
00:45:16,756 --> 00:45:19,759
Sanghyun stole the Seeker role
three or four times.

763
00:45:20,885 --> 00:45:25,139
So, I was determined
not to let Sanghyun become a Challenger.

764
00:45:30,770 --> 00:45:33,022
[Horseking] Seriously, I'm so mad
I can't take it.

765
00:45:35,816 --> 00:45:37,109
I'll go buy Stealth!

766
00:45:38,778 --> 00:45:39,862
I'd like Stealth, please.

767
00:45:39,946 --> 00:45:43,699
[dealer] You have selected Stealth.
Your time will increase by three minutes.

768
00:45:43,783 --> 00:45:45,910
HORSEKING HAS NOW BOUGHT
ATTACK AND STEALTH

769
00:45:47,370 --> 00:45:50,122
[host] The Seeker is currently at A2.

770
00:45:51,999 --> 00:45:53,000
[Horseking] A2!

771
00:45:53,960 --> 00:45:54,961
It's A2!

772
00:45:55,670 --> 00:45:56,671
-A2.
-Here, Jaegyun.

773
00:45:56,754 --> 00:45:58,381
-It's right here.
-A2's here.

774
00:46:10,434 --> 00:46:11,852
A2! A2!

775
00:46:11,936 --> 00:46:12,937
He's not here.

776
00:46:16,983 --> 00:46:19,443
[♪ interesting music playing]

777
00:46:19,527 --> 00:46:23,072
[Sanghyun] I was hiding behind the stairs
with a black bag over me.

778
00:46:23,155 --> 00:46:25,157
I could hear everyone
talking on the stairs.

779
00:46:25,241 --> 00:46:27,285
As Horseking went up the stairs, he said,

780
00:46:30,496 --> 00:46:31,622
I'll go buy Stealth!

781
00:46:33,749 --> 00:46:35,626
He was planning to steal my Stealth.

782
00:46:35,710 --> 00:46:37,878
But I didn't come out

783
00:46:37,962 --> 00:46:40,423
because even if they knew my location,

784
00:46:40,506 --> 00:46:43,050
there was almost no way
they'd find me behind the stairs.

785
00:46:45,845 --> 00:46:46,846
Youn Sanghyun!

786
00:46:54,645 --> 00:46:56,981
[Jaegyun] This is A2, but I'm telling you.
He's not here.

787
00:47:03,946 --> 00:47:06,157
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

788
00:47:09,869 --> 00:47:12,621
[Dail] Whenever Sanghyun hides,
it drives me absolutely crazy.

789
00:47:13,706 --> 00:47:16,667
[Horseking]
Just wait until I get my hands on you.

790
00:47:16,751 --> 00:47:17,918
This is driving me nuts!

791
00:47:27,470 --> 00:47:29,722
Geez, he's too good at hiding!

792
00:47:37,855 --> 00:47:38,981
Where did that punk go?

793
00:47:40,649 --> 00:47:43,361
[Horseking] I looked and looked,
but he was nowhere.

794
00:47:45,738 --> 00:47:47,490
-He used Gamble.
-[Jaegyun] What?

795
00:47:47,573 --> 00:47:49,200
[Dail] He used Gamble again.

796
00:47:49,283 --> 00:47:51,535
[host] The Seeker is currently at A2.

797
00:47:51,619 --> 00:47:54,955
Where is he? I'm going nuts.

798
00:47:55,039 --> 00:47:56,540
Six minutes, five, four, three.

799
00:47:56,624 --> 00:47:57,625
I was losing my mind.

800
00:47:57,708 --> 00:48:01,379
To be a Challenger... I can't believe
this kind of play is working!

801
00:48:01,462 --> 00:48:02,713
No. This can't happen.

802
00:48:02,797 --> 00:48:05,758
So, we all looked together,
but we couldn't find him anywhere.

803
00:48:06,550 --> 00:48:08,469
[Jimin] Is he hiding
in the yellow container again?

804
00:48:08,552 --> 00:48:09,595
[Dail] He's not there.

805
00:48:09,678 --> 00:48:11,430
[Jaegyun]
I'm telling you, he's not here at A2.

806
00:48:11,514 --> 00:48:12,973
[Horseking] This is driving me insane.

807
00:48:14,266 --> 00:48:15,601
Where did he go?

808
00:48:17,061 --> 00:48:18,229
Two minutes left!

809
00:48:18,312 --> 00:48:19,980
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

810
00:48:20,064 --> 00:48:21,232
Seriously.

811
00:48:21,315 --> 00:48:23,567
This punk is getting on my nerves again.

812
00:48:30,366 --> 00:48:32,284
Where is he?

813
00:48:36,664 --> 00:48:38,916
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

814
00:48:38,999 --> 00:48:40,000
Youn Sanghyun!

815
00:48:42,586 --> 00:48:45,214
[host] The Seeker is currently at A2.

816
00:48:45,297 --> 00:48:47,133
This is A2!

817
00:48:48,509 --> 00:48:49,593
[frustrated sigh]

818
00:48:53,431 --> 00:48:54,473
One minute left!

819
00:48:56,267 --> 00:48:57,309
One minute left!

820
00:49:04,024 --> 00:49:07,236
[Horseking] They said he was at A2,
so he had to be here.

821
00:49:09,071 --> 00:49:10,197
Not here.

822
00:49:14,702 --> 00:49:17,455
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

823
00:49:31,093 --> 00:49:32,761
[annoyed scream] Come here!

824
00:49:33,345 --> 00:49:34,805
You've been hiding here, you punk?

825
00:49:34,889 --> 00:49:36,974
TIME REMAINING

826
00:49:37,057 --> 00:49:38,309
[Sanghyun] Wait, give me one chance.

827
00:49:38,392 --> 00:49:40,478
[Horseking] I have to do this though.
You can't avoid it.

828
00:49:40,561 --> 00:49:41,812
You've done great. Come here.

829
00:49:41,896 --> 00:49:43,355
[Sanghyun] But that's
another five minutes.

830
00:49:43,439 --> 00:49:46,192
[Horseking] Come on. Come on, let's go.

831
00:49:47,776 --> 00:49:49,570
SANGHYUN LIES DOWN
AS HE RESISTS AND HANGS ON

832
00:49:49,653 --> 00:49:50,654
You little bastard.

833
00:49:51,447 --> 00:49:54,200
"TAG"
SEEKER: YOUN SANGHYUN

834
00:49:54,283 --> 00:49:56,494
TIME REMAINING

835
00:49:56,577 --> 00:49:58,913
-[Sanghyun] No, you can't!
-[Horseking] I can't tag him!

836
00:49:58,996 --> 00:50:00,372
You little bastard.

837
00:50:00,456 --> 00:50:01,874
Tag! Okay.

838
00:50:01,957 --> 00:50:03,501
[Sanghyun groans] Come on!

839
00:50:03,584 --> 00:50:05,085
[Horseking screams] I did it!

840
00:50:06,086 --> 00:50:08,005
-[Jaegyun] Horseking is the Seeker.
-Yeah, I did it.

841
00:50:08,631 --> 00:50:11,550
Hey, just give me
three seconds to run away. Okay?

842
00:50:12,134 --> 00:50:14,845
-[screams]
-[host] The Seeker has changed.

843
00:50:15,429 --> 00:50:16,430
I did it!

844
00:50:17,598 --> 00:50:19,141
I tagged him with four seconds left.

845
00:50:19,225 --> 00:50:20,476
It became 5 minutes and 4 seconds.

846
00:50:20,559 --> 00:50:21,560
ATTACK ABILITY ADDS 5 MINUTES

847
00:50:22,144 --> 00:50:23,354
It felt so good.

848
00:50:24,438 --> 00:50:25,439
I won.

849
00:50:28,901 --> 00:50:30,486
[Sanghyun] I can't believe
I got caught here.

850
00:50:34,490 --> 00:50:36,283
[Jimin] Ugh. That's insane.

851
00:50:36,367 --> 00:50:38,619
-You had four seconds left.
-What?

852
00:50:38,702 --> 00:50:40,162
-You had four seconds left.
-For real?

853
00:50:40,246 --> 00:50:41,288
Yeah.

854
00:50:42,039 --> 00:50:46,085
[sighs] I should've held out
for four more seconds.

855
00:50:46,168 --> 00:50:47,169
I was really disappointed.

856
00:50:48,420 --> 00:50:49,964
I'm going to go gamble again.

857
00:50:50,798 --> 00:50:52,258
Stealth is my ability though.

858
00:50:53,467 --> 00:50:54,635
Yeah, I can just do it again.

859
00:50:54,718 --> 00:50:56,554
SANGHYUN HEADS
TO DEALER ROOM TO BUY ABILITIES

860
00:50:56,637 --> 00:50:57,680
-Jimin.
-Yeah?

861
00:50:57,763 --> 00:50:59,265
You go up and buy Thief.

862
00:50:59,348 --> 00:51:03,310
Isn't Thief expensive as hell?
I think that punk raised it to 10 minutes.

863
00:51:05,980 --> 00:51:07,815
[Horseking] I was running away,
and then thought,

864
00:51:07,898 --> 00:51:09,233
"Maybe I should hide too."

865
00:51:09,316 --> 00:51:12,903
So I hid behind the machine,
because I could just run if I'm caught.

866
00:51:15,406 --> 00:51:19,076
One minute, two minutes,
three minutes passed, and no one came.

867
00:51:19,159 --> 00:51:20,744
Why aren't they looking for me?

868
00:51:20,828 --> 00:51:22,037
I just kept hiding.

869
00:51:22,621 --> 00:51:25,291
[host] The Seeker is currently at D5.

870
00:51:26,208 --> 00:51:27,626
[Sanghyun] D5.

871
00:51:33,966 --> 00:51:36,343
THE PLAYERS MOVE
AS SOON AS HORSEKING'S LOCATION IS SHOWN

872
00:51:41,765 --> 00:51:44,143
[♪ ominous music playing]

873
00:51:51,025 --> 00:51:53,235
[Horseking] The light was red,
so I was covering it up.

874
00:51:53,319 --> 00:51:54,945
I was kept trembling there.

875
00:52:00,492 --> 00:52:02,494
Dail, you haven't found Horseking yet?

876
00:52:02,578 --> 00:52:04,371
[Dail] He's hiding somewhere.

877
00:52:05,164 --> 00:52:07,124
[Jaegyun] Horseking's pretty good
at hiding too.

878
00:52:07,750 --> 00:52:09,293
[Dail] I've searched all around here.

879
00:52:10,252 --> 00:52:13,631
Horseking, I think Sanghyun
bought the Thief. Come on out.

880
00:52:14,214 --> 00:52:16,925
[host] The Seeker is currently at D5.

881
00:52:20,638 --> 00:52:23,307
[Horseking] My heart was pounding,
and I started sweating.

882
00:52:23,390 --> 00:52:25,059
I was getting all excited by myself,

883
00:52:25,142 --> 00:52:27,144
and thought, "Could this actually work?"

884
00:52:28,479 --> 00:52:31,065
His time has dropped so much.

885
00:52:31,148 --> 00:52:32,650
9 MINUTES NOW REMAINING FOR HORSEKING

886
00:52:33,400 --> 00:52:34,818
[exclaims] This is insane.

887
00:52:38,030 --> 00:52:39,740
[Sanghyun] I need to go get him.

888
00:52:40,908 --> 00:52:42,242
This is so annoying.

889
00:52:42,326 --> 00:52:43,327
I went to the Dealer Room.

890
00:52:43,410 --> 00:52:46,789
Stealth, Thief, Gamble, and Quick Revive.

891
00:52:46,872 --> 00:52:49,375
[dealer]
Your time has increased by 11 minutes.

892
00:52:50,959 --> 00:52:53,504
[Sanghyun] I bought the abilities
and went right back into hiding.

893
00:52:54,296 --> 00:52:55,464
But no one could find Horseking.

894
00:52:55,547 --> 00:52:56,548
SEEKER'S CURRENT LOCATION

895
00:52:56,632 --> 00:52:58,467
I thought, "What's with them?"

896
00:53:00,594 --> 00:53:02,179
I got frustrated and came out.

897
00:53:05,057 --> 00:53:06,475
Is D5 here?

898
00:53:06,558 --> 00:53:10,396
Sanghyun, find him for us
with your hiding skills.

899
00:53:11,647 --> 00:53:14,358
[host] The Seeker is currently at D5.

900
00:53:16,276 --> 00:53:18,028
[exclaims] The time left is no joke.

901
00:53:18,862 --> 00:53:21,824
CURRENTLY IN 1ST
HORSEKING QUICKLY REACHES 5-MINUTE MARK

902
00:53:31,542 --> 00:53:32,876
Here!

903
00:53:33,544 --> 00:53:34,962
-Did you find me?
-Right here!

904
00:53:36,004 --> 00:53:37,381
Let's run!

905
00:53:38,799 --> 00:53:40,759
[laughs] How many minutes have passed?

906
00:53:50,102 --> 00:53:51,353
[laughs cunningly]

907
00:53:59,903 --> 00:54:01,613
Whoo-hoo!

908
00:54:03,866 --> 00:54:05,159
Here!

909
00:54:11,081 --> 00:54:12,416
-I ran so much.
-[Jaegyun] Come here.

910
00:54:12,499 --> 00:54:14,501
Okay, I can't run anymore.

911
00:54:15,085 --> 00:54:17,379
HWANG JAEGYUN TAGS HORSEKING

912
00:54:17,463 --> 00:54:19,381
[host] The Seeker has changed.

913
00:54:19,882 --> 00:54:21,175
[Horseking] My legs are numb.

914
00:54:23,218 --> 00:54:24,678
[frustrated groan]

915
00:54:25,721 --> 00:54:27,431
Where did Sanghyun go?

916
00:54:27,514 --> 00:54:28,891
Hey!

917
00:54:36,648 --> 00:54:37,649
Hey!

918
00:54:37,733 --> 00:54:39,401
-[host] The Seeker has changed.
-[Jaegyun] Dail.

919
00:54:39,485 --> 00:54:40,652
YANG DAIL TAGS YOUN SANGHYUN

920
00:54:40,736 --> 00:54:41,779
I'm so tired!

921
00:54:42,946 --> 00:54:44,573
Gosh, I'm so tired.

922
00:54:49,119 --> 00:54:50,954
-[Horseking] Are you all right?
-[groaning]

923
00:54:51,038 --> 00:54:53,332
[Dail] After about 10 hours,

924
00:54:53,415 --> 00:54:56,084
the back of my legs were giving out on me.

925
00:54:56,168 --> 00:54:57,669
I kept getting hurt,

926
00:54:58,420 --> 00:55:01,298
but I still couldn't give up.

927
00:55:01,381 --> 00:55:02,799
I couldn't let it end like this.

928
00:55:02,883 --> 00:55:05,719
At least for this game,
I wanted to fight until the very end.

929
00:55:05,802 --> 00:55:08,180
He's over here!

930
00:55:12,893 --> 00:55:14,728
[host] The Seeker has changed.

931
00:55:14,811 --> 00:55:16,396
-He's fast as hell.
-[Jaegyun] Over here!

932
00:55:17,481 --> 00:55:20,943
[Jimin] I gave it my all to run,
and I kept trying to catch them.

933
00:55:21,026 --> 00:55:22,110
Damn...

934
00:55:24,363 --> 00:55:27,658
But my body couldn't keep up anymore,
so it was infuriating.

935
00:55:28,450 --> 00:55:31,203
-[host] The Seeker has changed.
-[Horseking annoyed scream]

936
00:55:31,286 --> 00:55:33,121
-[Jaegyun] Hey.
-[host] The Seeker has changed.

937
00:55:33,205 --> 00:55:34,331
10 HOURS INTO THE GAME

938
00:55:34,414 --> 00:55:36,166
[host] The Seeker has changed.

939
00:55:36,250 --> 00:55:38,043
[Jimin]
We've been running around for 10 hours.

940
00:55:41,296 --> 00:55:43,507
[panting]

941
00:55:46,260 --> 00:55:48,845
[Horseking] Hey, he's tired now, you punk!
Move out of the way.

942
00:55:49,930 --> 00:55:53,350
[Jaegyun] I've never run continuously
for this long before.

943
00:55:53,433 --> 00:55:55,477
It was really, really tough.

944
00:55:57,646 --> 00:55:59,022
[screams] Here I come!

945
00:56:03,360 --> 00:56:04,736
Come here!

946
00:56:05,904 --> 00:56:08,532
Hey, don't follow him.

947
00:56:10,075 --> 00:56:11,702
[Horseking] We were so worn out.

948
00:56:12,452 --> 00:56:14,454
My legs hurt so bad.

949
00:56:23,046 --> 00:56:24,590
[Jaegyun] Just let me go!

950
00:56:25,966 --> 00:56:27,301
Wait, my leg...

951
00:56:27,384 --> 00:56:30,262
I can't run anymore. I can't run.

952
00:56:30,345 --> 00:56:31,847
[host] The Seeker has changed.

953
00:56:31,930 --> 00:56:34,725
[♪ pensive music playing]

954
00:56:34,808 --> 00:56:36,977
[panting heavily]

955
00:56:41,398 --> 00:56:44,943
[Jaegyun]
Unfortunately, I pulled a hamstring.

956
00:56:45,027 --> 00:56:46,612
Back when I was playing,

957
00:56:46,695 --> 00:56:50,907
I tore my hamstring
in that exact same spot.

958
00:56:50,991 --> 00:56:54,494
So, I knew exactly what that feeling was.

959
00:56:54,578 --> 00:56:57,205
I felt that same pull
in the back of my thigh.

960
00:56:57,873 --> 00:57:02,419
If I hadn't stopped right then,
I'm pretty sure it would've torn again.

961
00:57:03,253 --> 00:57:07,799
I was really disappointed,
but I said I would drop out.

962
00:57:09,551 --> 00:57:12,262
If I hadn't been injured,

963
00:57:13,055 --> 00:57:14,473
I feel like

964
00:57:15,807 --> 00:57:20,437
I might've had
a really good shot at winning.

965
00:57:20,520 --> 00:57:24,608
So, I was really disappointed.

966
00:57:25,609 --> 00:57:28,028
SAFETY PRECAUTIONS WERE TAKEN
AS THE CAST MEMBER RECEIVED

967
00:57:28,111 --> 00:57:29,821
PROPER FIRST AID AND CARE AFTER THE INJURY

968
00:57:29,905 --> 00:57:32,282
There he is! Behind the container!

969
00:57:33,367 --> 00:57:36,703
ROUND 3 CONTINUES WITHOUT HWANG JAEGYUN

970
00:57:48,256 --> 00:57:51,051
[♪ intense music playing]

971
00:57:55,263 --> 00:57:57,265
[Horseking] Here I come! Come here!

972
00:57:58,850 --> 00:58:01,645
Okay! All right!

973
00:58:01,728 --> 00:58:02,729
"TAG"
SEEKER: HORSEKING

974
00:58:02,813 --> 00:58:04,064
"TAG"
SEEKER: YANG DAIL

975
00:58:04,147 --> 00:58:06,441
[Horseking]
Since abilities extend your time...

976
00:58:06,525 --> 00:58:09,069
People kept tagging each other,
time would go back and forth.

977
00:58:09,152 --> 00:58:11,363
It was bound to turn into an endless loop.

978
00:58:14,449 --> 00:58:17,744
[Dail] It's been 10 hours.
Ten hours of "Tag."

979
00:58:17,828 --> 00:58:19,162
[tired sigh]

980
00:58:19,246 --> 00:58:21,081
[Horseking] I thought I was going to die.

981
00:58:21,748 --> 00:58:23,625
[Jimin] My feet are killing me.

982
00:58:24,251 --> 00:58:26,503
Everyone was getting
more and more exhausted.

983
00:58:27,713 --> 00:58:30,090
[Sanghyun] Everyone's times
had become ridiculously high.

984
00:58:30,173 --> 00:58:31,591
[buzzer sounding]

985
00:58:31,675 --> 00:58:34,720
Sanghyun has 32 minutes. That's insane.

986
00:58:34,803 --> 00:58:39,516
[host] There have been 20 tags.
Round 3 is now over.

987
00:58:42,728 --> 00:58:44,479
DEADLY TAG

988
00:58:45,188 --> 00:58:47,107
[host] As Round 3 has ended,

989
00:58:47,858 --> 00:58:52,070
the End Rule for the finals
will now take effect.

990
00:58:55,073 --> 00:58:56,283
Under the End Rule,

991
00:58:56,366 --> 00:58:59,035
the current game rules
will now be reversed.

992
00:58:59,119 --> 00:59:00,537
[Sanghyun] Oh.

993
00:59:01,079 --> 00:59:02,497
Instead of chasing the Seeker,

994
00:59:02,581 --> 00:59:05,959
you now have to survive
by avoiding the Seeker.

995
00:59:06,752 --> 00:59:10,380
The player with the most remaining time
from the previous round

996
00:59:10,464 --> 00:59:12,007
will become the first Seeker.

997
00:59:12,799 --> 00:59:16,970
They have 10 minutes
to tag another player.

998
00:59:17,637 --> 00:59:21,183
Only the Seeker's time will count down
while they have the right to tag.

999
00:59:21,266 --> 00:59:23,185
If the Seeker successfully tags someone,

1000
00:59:23,268 --> 00:59:25,353
they will survive
with their remaining time,

1001
00:59:26,062 --> 00:59:28,982
and the tagged player
becomes the next Seeker.

1002
00:59:30,233 --> 00:59:34,488
But if the Seeker fails to tag anyone,
that player is immediately eliminated.

1003
00:59:35,322 --> 00:59:38,784
If the Seeker is eliminated,
the turn passes on to the next player.

1004
00:59:38,867 --> 00:59:42,120
If no one is eliminated
after one round of turns,

1005
00:59:42,204 --> 00:59:44,247
the game will continue in the same order

1006
00:59:44,331 --> 00:59:47,667
until the players'
remaining times run out.

1007
00:59:49,294 --> 00:59:51,588
The player with the most time
from the last round,

1008
00:59:51,671 --> 00:59:53,465
Youn Sanghyun, will be the first Seeker.

1009
00:59:53,548 --> 00:59:54,549
2ND PARK JIMIN

1010
00:59:54,633 --> 00:59:56,635
After that, the order will be as follows.

1011
00:59:56,718 --> 00:59:57,928
3RD YANG DAIL
4TH HORSEKING

1012
00:59:58,595 --> 01:00:01,431
[Sanghyun] The Seeker is the one
doing the hunting this time.

1013
01:00:01,515 --> 01:00:04,893
[host] And once only two players remain,

1014
01:00:05,685 --> 01:00:09,815
the game will switch to a one-on-one match
to determine the winner.

1015
01:00:12,943 --> 01:00:19,199
[Sanghyun] I honestly think I'll be able
to tag someone within 10 minutes.

1016
01:00:19,282 --> 01:00:22,911
With this strategy, I might survive.
I might even win the whole thing.

1017
01:00:23,745 --> 01:00:27,332
This time, it's a real game of tag.
The Seeker is the one chasing.

1018
01:00:27,415 --> 01:00:30,168
This is the last game
that will decide the winner.

1019
01:00:30,252 --> 01:00:31,795
Let's settle it once and for all!

1020
01:00:31,878 --> 01:00:34,631
With a 10-minute time limit,

1021
01:00:34,714 --> 01:00:38,844
I thought that if I could hide well
and tag just one person, I could win.

1022
01:00:39,803 --> 01:00:40,846
[Dail] Hmm.

1023
01:00:40,929 --> 01:00:43,056
This is the rule I'd been waiting for.

1024
01:00:43,139 --> 01:00:47,018
I only had to find one person.
Find them and take them out.

1025
01:00:47,561 --> 01:00:50,105
[host]
We will begin the chase in one minute

1026
01:00:50,188 --> 01:00:52,691
with the first Seeker, Youn Sanghyun.

1027
01:00:53,233 --> 01:00:56,236
Youn Sanghyun, with the right to tag,

1028
01:00:56,319 --> 01:00:58,321
cannot move for one minute.

1029
01:00:59,781 --> 01:01:02,242
PLAYERS LOOK FOR PLACES TO HIDE

1030
01:01:04,035 --> 01:01:06,955
[Jimin] I hid between some containers

1031
01:01:07,038 --> 01:01:09,165
where it was too dark to see well.

1032
01:01:09,916 --> 01:01:13,336
PARK JIMIN'S HIDING NEAR EXIT 1

1033
01:01:13,420 --> 01:01:17,382
[Dail] Hiding was important,
but I had to be able to run immediately.

1034
01:01:17,465 --> 01:01:21,052
YANG DAIL'S HIDING BEHIND EXIT 4

1035
01:01:24,598 --> 01:01:26,558
[Horseking]
I didn't really know where to hide.

1036
01:01:35,191 --> 01:01:37,152
HORSEKING IS STILL LOOKING
FOR A HIDING SPOT

1037
01:01:41,781 --> 01:01:42,824
[alarm blaring]

1038
01:01:42,908 --> 01:01:44,701
[host]
The first Seeker under the End Rule,

1039
01:01:44,784 --> 01:01:47,621
Youn Sanghyun, you may start.

1040
01:01:49,080 --> 01:01:52,125
[Horseking] I haven't even found a place
to hide yet. But the alarm went off.

1041
01:01:52,208 --> 01:01:53,877
Sanghyun was already chasing me...

1042
01:01:57,380 --> 01:01:59,507
so I found a gap in the wall
and hid there.

1043
01:02:12,312 --> 01:02:14,522
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1044
01:02:15,690 --> 01:02:21,404
SANGHYUN HEADS TOWARD HORSEKING
AND DAIL NEAR EXIT 4

1045
01:02:35,585 --> 01:02:36,711
SPOTS HORSEKING RIGHT AWAY

1046
01:02:45,011 --> 01:02:48,181
[Sanghyun] The second he saw me,
Horseking took off running like crazy.

1047
01:02:48,264 --> 01:02:50,600
So, I was determined
to chase him until the end.

1048
01:02:53,395 --> 01:02:56,606
SANGHYUN SPOTS DAIL
WHILE CHASING HORSEKING

1049
01:02:57,232 --> 01:03:00,610
[Sanghyun] Even better.
Let's herd both of them together.

1050
01:03:12,789 --> 01:03:16,001
At one point, I was running,
and Yang Dail was running too.

1051
01:03:17,502 --> 01:03:21,089
All right! I thought I could use
Dail to lure him away.

1052
01:03:21,172 --> 01:03:23,258
I ran alongside Dail for a bit,

1053
01:03:24,300 --> 01:03:26,469
and then suddenly,
I went the other way from him.

1054
01:03:26,553 --> 01:03:29,014
So now, the odds
were basically fifty-fifty.

1055
01:03:34,352 --> 01:03:36,271
SANGHYUN HEADS TOWARD YANG DAIL

1056
01:03:54,581 --> 01:03:55,707
YOUN SANGHYUN TAGS YANG DAIL

1057
01:03:55,790 --> 01:04:00,170
[host] Youn Sanghyun and Yang Dail.
Tag confirmed.

1058
01:04:00,253 --> 01:04:03,757
Youn Sanghyun has six minutes
and 25 seconds remaining.

1059
01:04:04,591 --> 01:04:07,135
YOUN SANGHYUN'S TAG WAS SUCCESSFUL

1060
01:04:07,218 --> 01:04:09,512
But for the first time,

1061
01:04:09,971 --> 01:04:12,599
as I was running behind Dail,

1062
01:04:12,682 --> 01:04:15,810
it felt like I could see
the word '"winner" written on his back.

1063
01:04:15,894 --> 01:04:18,772
It felt like I absolutely had to tag him,

1064
01:04:18,855 --> 01:04:20,356
so I couldn't even smile.

1065
01:04:21,441 --> 01:04:23,068
And it made me think,

1066
01:04:23,151 --> 01:04:25,653
"Suddenly, I really want
to win this thing."

1067
01:04:26,696 --> 01:04:29,240
After tagging him,
I had to hide as quickly as possible

1068
01:04:29,324 --> 01:04:31,451
while no one was watching.

1069
01:04:31,534 --> 01:04:35,455
I went to a spot
I'd already picked out and hid there.

1070
01:04:42,045 --> 01:04:44,172
[host] Next is Yang Dail.

1071
01:04:44,255 --> 01:04:48,134
Yang Dail, you will begin
your chase in one minute.

1072
01:04:48,635 --> 01:04:50,386
[Dail panting]

1073
01:04:50,470 --> 01:04:52,180
My goodness!

1074
01:04:59,270 --> 01:05:00,271
Goodness.

1075
01:05:01,147 --> 01:05:02,148
My goodness.

1076
01:05:02,857 --> 01:05:04,150
I can't do this anymore.

1077
01:05:05,360 --> 01:05:08,029
My feet hurt. [groans]

1078
01:05:08,113 --> 01:05:10,073
YANG DAIL KEPT PLAYING
DESPITE "KINGMAKER" INJURY

1079
01:05:10,156 --> 01:05:15,870
[Dail] I ran as much as my body
would allow me to.

1080
01:05:15,954 --> 01:05:19,290
I just grit my teeth
and used every ounce of strength to run.

1081
01:05:19,958 --> 01:05:23,503
But when it was my turn to hunt,
I was exhausted.

1082
01:05:26,923 --> 01:05:28,216
[alarm blaring]

1083
01:05:28,299 --> 01:05:31,678
[host] The second Seeker,
Yang Dail, you may start.

1084
01:05:32,804 --> 01:05:34,722
[Dail] At that point,
I couldn't even think straight.

1085
01:05:35,265 --> 01:05:36,266
What am I supposed to do?

1086
01:05:36,349 --> 01:05:39,144
Now, it's a test of mental strength.

1087
01:05:40,603 --> 01:05:41,604
It hurts.

1088
01:05:42,355 --> 01:05:47,569
I can't just let it end like this.
I have to fight until the very end.

1089
01:05:49,195 --> 01:05:52,866
I just have to keep running
as long as this leg can still move.

1090
01:05:57,662 --> 01:06:00,832
YANG DAIL REFUSES TO GIVE UP

1091
01:06:43,541 --> 01:06:45,460
[Dail] I couldn't see anyone,
and no one was coming out.

1092
01:06:45,543 --> 01:06:47,295
I wanted to win so badly,

1093
01:06:47,378 --> 01:06:50,131
but things weren't going
the way I wanted, so it was upsetting.

1094
01:06:52,091 --> 01:06:58,640
YANG DAIL

1095
01:07:00,058 --> 01:07:01,100
Goodness.

1096
01:07:01,809 --> 01:07:04,729
[host] Three minutes remaining.

1097
01:07:06,439 --> 01:07:09,317
[groaning]

1098
01:07:18,159 --> 01:07:19,452
[Jaegyun] Dail might be eliminated.

1099
01:07:21,537 --> 01:07:24,415
YANG DAIL

1100
01:07:25,041 --> 01:07:26,042
No one's here.

1101
01:07:26,793 --> 01:07:27,794
Goodness.

1102
01:07:28,503 --> 01:07:29,629
[sighs in exasperation]

1103
01:07:35,593 --> 01:07:36,886
Good job, everyone.

1104
01:07:37,679 --> 01:07:40,306
-I can't run.
-[host] Sixty seconds remaining.

1105
01:07:40,390 --> 01:07:44,560
[groans] I can't run anymore!

1106
01:07:45,395 --> 01:07:46,938
[Dail] I was so annoyed.

1107
01:07:47,021 --> 01:07:51,401
Why did I push myself that hard

1108
01:07:51,484 --> 01:07:57,573
for my team
and get injured playing "Kingmaker"?

1109
01:08:00,660 --> 01:08:04,163
If I hadn't gotten injured,
I could have won.

1110
01:08:15,174 --> 01:08:16,301
[groans]

1111
01:08:18,136 --> 01:08:19,387
It hurts.

1112
01:08:20,847 --> 01:08:21,848
[sighs]

1113
01:08:23,141 --> 01:08:25,143
[alarm blaring]

1114
01:08:25,226 --> 01:08:29,897
[host] Yang Dail, you have used up
your 10 minutes and have been eliminated.

1115
01:08:30,940 --> 01:08:34,319
Please exit the area immediately.

1116
01:08:35,320 --> 01:08:37,322
God damn it, that hurts.

1117
01:08:37,405 --> 01:08:42,660
[Dail] I thought I'd feel relieved
once it was over, but I didn't.

1118
01:08:43,119 --> 01:08:46,789
I really wanted to win this time.

1119
01:08:46,873 --> 01:08:50,293
It was hard to let go.

1120
01:08:53,171 --> 01:08:56,799
I want to say I felt relieved,
but I still have regrets.

1121
01:08:56,883 --> 01:08:59,302
You did a good job. You really did.

1122
01:09:01,137 --> 01:09:03,181
-They're way too good at hiding.
-[Dail groans]

1123
01:09:03,264 --> 01:09:04,974
I couldn't see them either.

1124
01:09:05,558 --> 01:09:08,102
-I couldn't find them by running around.
-Yeah. [chuckles]

1125
01:09:08,770 --> 01:09:10,104
My toe hurts so bad.

1126
01:09:17,111 --> 01:09:22,367
[host] The next person with the right
to tag as the Seeker is Park Jimin.

1127
01:09:22,450 --> 01:09:26,162
Park Jimin, you will begin
your chase in one minute.

1128
01:09:26,245 --> 01:09:28,790
[Jimin]
Dail had his turn, and now it's mine.

1129
01:09:28,873 --> 01:09:31,334
I think I've got a shot.

1130
01:09:31,417 --> 01:09:34,253
The overtime round
gave me a little bit of hope.

1131
01:09:34,337 --> 01:09:36,381
I just need to tag one person.

1132
01:09:38,883 --> 01:09:41,052
HORSEKING CONTINUES HIDING
UNDER THE STAIRS

1133
01:09:42,637 --> 01:09:44,389
YOUN SANGHYUN IS NEAR EXIT 3

1134
01:09:46,891 --> 01:09:49,352
[alarm blaring]

1135
01:09:49,435 --> 01:09:52,814
[host] The third Seeker,
Park Jimin, you may start.

1136
01:09:52,897 --> 01:09:55,608
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1137
01:10:12,667 --> 01:10:14,961
PARK JIMIN

1138
01:10:18,548 --> 01:10:22,009
PARK JIMIN APPROACHES YOUN SANGHYUN

1139
01:10:26,431 --> 01:10:27,473
I found him.

1140
01:10:32,353 --> 01:10:33,646
[Jimin sighs]

1141
01:10:43,406 --> 01:10:46,659
PARK JIMIN TRIES TO CUT HIM OFF
FROM THE OTHER SIDE

1142
01:10:50,079 --> 01:10:51,205
Where did he go?

1143
01:10:52,373 --> 01:10:55,251
YOUN SANGHYUN HAS ALREADY ESCAPED

1144
01:10:56,335 --> 01:11:00,923
[Jimin] I ran as fast as I could,
but I ended up losing Sanghyun.

1145
01:11:05,803 --> 01:11:07,555
SPOTS HORSEKING UNDER THE STAIRS

1146
01:11:07,638 --> 01:11:08,681
Ah!

1147
01:11:10,057 --> 01:11:11,267
[frustrated sigh]

1148
01:11:12,185 --> 01:11:15,521
PARK JIMIN MISSES HORSEKING
RIGHT IN FRONT OF HER

1149
01:11:15,605 --> 01:11:18,900
I think I missed him
by just a split second.

1150
01:11:20,067 --> 01:11:21,694
PARK JIMIN

1151
01:11:27,909 --> 01:11:29,368
[frustrated sigh]

1152
01:11:29,452 --> 01:11:30,661
This is so annoying.

1153
01:11:32,663 --> 01:11:35,124
My body couldn't keep up anymore,
so it was infuriating.

1154
01:11:35,666 --> 01:11:39,921
I was so angry at my own legs.
I was getting frustrated.

1155
01:11:40,505 --> 01:11:41,547
[sighs]

1156
01:11:42,965 --> 01:11:44,467
Where the hell is Sanghyun?

1157
01:11:48,346 --> 01:11:51,933
My legs felt like they were tearing apart,

1158
01:11:52,016 --> 01:11:53,893
and I'm about to get eliminated.

1159
01:11:58,773 --> 01:12:02,819
PARK JIMIN

1160
01:12:17,291 --> 01:12:19,460
I still couldn't find anyone.

1161
01:12:20,670 --> 01:12:22,755
I wondered,
"Can I make it through this?"

1162
01:12:27,468 --> 01:12:31,973
[Jimin] I'd been a Seeker before,
gone to the Death Match twice,

1163
01:12:35,643 --> 01:12:38,938
and been dismissed as the weakest player

1164
01:12:41,190 --> 01:12:44,610
by so many people throughout the game.

1165
01:12:45,945 --> 01:12:48,155
I got you! Tag!

1166
01:12:48,781 --> 01:12:50,366
I did my best and didn't quit

1167
01:12:52,910 --> 01:12:54,996
to make it all the way to the finals,

1168
01:12:57,999 --> 01:12:59,834
so I couldn't go home like this.

1169
01:13:06,757 --> 01:13:07,800
Hold on.

1170
01:13:13,180 --> 01:13:17,518
PARK JIMIN

1171
01:13:19,604 --> 01:13:20,938
There he is.

1172
01:13:23,065 --> 01:13:25,818
PARK JIMIN GETS A LAST CHANCE

1173
01:13:27,695 --> 01:13:30,156
PARK JIMIN

1174
01:13:31,991 --> 01:13:33,409
[Jimin laughs]

1175
01:13:34,368 --> 01:13:37,622
[buzzer sounding]

1176
01:13:41,083 --> 01:13:45,755
[host] Park Jimin, you have used up
your 10 minutes and have been eliminated.

1177
01:13:46,297 --> 01:13:50,343
Park Jimin will not be able
to return to Deadly Tag.

1178
01:13:54,055 --> 01:13:58,184
Still, I did everything I could
until the end to catch someone.

1179
01:13:59,810 --> 01:14:02,521
I gave it my all, so I have no regrets.

1180
01:14:02,605 --> 01:14:05,191
Of course,
I'm disappointed about being eliminated,

1181
01:14:06,150 --> 01:14:08,945
but making it to the finals
was incredibly difficult.

1182
01:14:09,028 --> 01:14:12,198
Luck, skill, and so many other factors.

1183
01:14:12,281 --> 01:14:15,326
Everything had to come together
just to make it this far.

1184
01:14:15,826 --> 01:14:20,456
So, I'm really honored
to have made it to the finals.

1185
01:14:20,539 --> 01:14:22,083
It also gave me a lot of confidence.

1186
01:14:22,166 --> 01:14:26,629
It was incredibly tough,
but I'm really, really proud of myself.

1187
01:14:27,171 --> 01:14:28,881
It was a really happy experience.

1188
01:14:32,760 --> 01:14:36,222
[host] The final two players in Deadly Tag

1189
01:14:36,305 --> 01:14:40,017
are Horseking and Youn Sanghyun.

1190
01:14:41,268 --> 01:14:46,357
With two players left, the final match
will become a one-on-one showdown.

1191
01:14:46,941 --> 01:14:47,984
Congratulations.

1192
01:14:48,442 --> 01:14:49,443
Hey, congratulations.

1193
01:14:51,696 --> 01:14:53,739
[Sanghyun sighs] Seriously.

1194
01:14:54,907 --> 01:14:57,243
I gave you such a hard time,
but you still survived.

1195
01:14:57,326 --> 01:14:59,453
-I've got to give you credit.
-[laughs]

1196
01:15:01,163 --> 01:15:04,959
Sanghyun was one of the players
who wanted to win really badly.

1197
01:15:05,042 --> 01:15:07,253
He wanted it badly and played really well.

1198
01:15:07,795 --> 01:15:09,630
[Sanghyun]
I thought Horseking was the player

1199
01:15:10,256 --> 01:15:13,551
I needed to watch out for the most
in Deadly Tag.

1200
01:15:13,634 --> 01:15:16,387
He's very athletic
and is capable of outsmarting opponents.

1201
01:15:17,430 --> 01:15:20,016
[Horseking]
We both thought the other would win,

1202
01:15:20,099 --> 01:15:21,600
and we both made the finals,

1203
01:15:21,684 --> 01:15:23,644
so it felt kind of surreal.

1204
01:15:23,728 --> 01:15:27,023
Now, we get to settle this man to man.

1205
01:15:27,106 --> 01:15:28,899
[Sanghyun] I saw
that I actually had a shot,

1206
01:15:28,983 --> 01:15:30,568
so I suddenly had a desire to win.

1207
01:15:30,651 --> 01:15:31,819
It was doable.

1208
01:15:33,029 --> 01:15:36,949
[host] Without further ado,
let the one-on-one final match begin.

1209
01:15:37,450 --> 01:15:39,535
[♪ suspenseful music playing]

1210
01:15:44,040 --> 01:15:47,209
[host] In the one-on-one final match,
each player must tag the other

1211
01:15:47,918 --> 01:15:49,837
and then escape
through their designated exit.

1212
01:15:49,920 --> 01:15:53,090
The first player to escape wins.

1213
01:15:54,300 --> 01:15:56,385
Horseking's designated exit is Exit 2,

1214
01:15:58,137 --> 01:16:01,682
and Youn Sanghyun's designated exit
is Exit 5.

1215
01:16:01,766 --> 01:16:04,018
The doors to both exits are locked.

1216
01:16:04,977 --> 01:16:07,521
Both players can attempt
to tag each other at the same time.

1217
01:16:07,605 --> 01:16:11,442
The player who tags first
will have the light on their arm turn red,

1218
01:16:12,443 --> 01:16:15,488
and the tagged player
will have their light turn yellow,

1219
01:16:15,571 --> 01:16:18,699
freezing them in place for five seconds.

1220
01:16:19,283 --> 01:16:22,369
After tagging the opponent,
tag the door of your designated exit

1221
01:16:22,453 --> 01:16:25,873
to start a 10-second countdown.

1222
01:16:25,956 --> 01:16:29,335
If you are not tagged
during those 10 seconds,

1223
01:16:29,418 --> 01:16:31,837
the exit door will open, and you will win.

1224
01:16:32,546 --> 01:16:36,092
Stop your opponent from escaping
and be the first one out.

1225
01:16:37,968 --> 01:16:41,972
[alarm blaring]

1226
01:16:46,268 --> 01:16:48,020
[Jimin] Wait,
isn't this basically wrestling?

1227
01:16:48,104 --> 01:16:50,231
[Jaegyun]
It's not going to be easy to get through.

1228
01:17:02,201 --> 01:17:05,579
[Sanghyun] Horseking is fast and strong,

1229
01:17:05,663 --> 01:17:07,790
so I wanted to end things in one go.

1230
01:17:07,873 --> 01:17:09,917
I had longer arms and legs than him.

1231
01:17:14,880 --> 01:17:18,592
[Horseking] Sanghyun was really locked in.
He kept coming in to tag me.

1232
01:17:18,676 --> 01:17:21,053
And his arms were shockingly long.

1233
01:17:22,471 --> 01:17:24,014
Oh. Oh.

1234
01:17:35,067 --> 01:17:36,318
[groans]

1235
01:17:41,615 --> 01:17:42,616
[Jimin] This is insane.

1236
01:17:58,883 --> 01:18:00,426
-Shall we let go?
-Okay.

1237
01:18:02,136 --> 01:18:03,929
It must be so nerve-racking!

1238
01:18:04,013 --> 01:18:06,098
[Sanghyun]
It was really hard to get a clean tag.

1239
01:18:06,182 --> 01:18:08,142
I thought, "I'm not getting anywhere."

1240
01:18:08,225 --> 01:18:09,685
[Horseking] I could actually lose this.

1241
01:18:09,768 --> 01:18:11,979
That's when I really locked in too.

1242
01:18:12,062 --> 01:18:15,107
[Sanghyun] Let's be confident,
get a solid grip, and tag him in one go.

1243
01:18:15,191 --> 01:18:17,109
All right, let's do this.

1244
01:18:22,239 --> 01:18:23,699
[Jimin exclaims]

1245
01:18:28,954 --> 01:18:30,247
[Jimin exclaims] This is crazy.

1246
01:18:30,331 --> 01:18:32,499
THE TAGGED PLAYER
CANNOT MOVE FOR FIVE SECONDS

1247
01:18:33,209 --> 01:18:34,210
Damn...

1248
01:18:34,585 --> 01:18:35,628
This is so intense.

1249
01:18:49,558 --> 01:18:52,436
TIME REMAINING

1250
01:18:52,519 --> 01:18:53,520
Over here, you punk.

1251
01:18:53,604 --> 01:18:55,940
[Sanghyun breathing heavily]

1252
01:19:03,322 --> 01:19:05,449
-Who knows what will happen?
-Here's my chance.

1253
01:19:05,532 --> 01:19:07,493
[Sanghyun]
There's no way I'm letting this slip away.

1254
01:19:07,576 --> 01:19:10,079
-I had to stay calm and composed.
-Until the end.

1255
01:19:10,162 --> 01:19:11,789
[Horseking] Just hold out for 10 seconds.

1256
01:19:11,872 --> 01:19:13,207
[Sanghyun] I have to tag him.

1257
01:19:13,290 --> 01:19:14,375
[Horseking] I'm going to win.

1258
01:19:14,458 --> 01:19:15,542
[Sanghyun] I will win.

1259
01:19:16,460 --> 01:19:17,544
[exclaiming]

1260
01:19:17,628 --> 01:19:20,589
TIME REMAINING

1261
01:19:33,018 --> 01:19:35,771
-Is it over?
-Exit 2 is open.

1262
01:19:36,355 --> 01:19:40,609
HORSEKING SUCCESSFULLY ESCAPES
THROUGH EXIT 2

1263
01:19:40,693 --> 01:19:41,819
[loudly] Yes!

1264
01:19:42,903 --> 01:19:44,613
[Jimin exclaims] Horseking.

1265
01:19:46,824 --> 01:19:49,076
[sighs, groans]

1266
01:19:54,290 --> 01:19:55,708
You did great, Sanghyun.

1267
01:19:55,791 --> 01:19:57,042
-Well done.
-[Jaegyun] Good work.

1268
01:19:57,126 --> 01:19:59,753
-[Jimin] You did great, Sanghyun.
-[Dail] Good job.

1269
01:20:00,587 --> 01:20:03,424
It didn't even feel bittersweet.
I just felt relieved.

1270
01:20:04,425 --> 01:20:07,052
I didn't feel sad or disappointed at all.

1271
01:20:07,136 --> 01:20:09,471
I was just so happy for him.

1272
01:20:10,222 --> 01:20:12,057
Because Horseking played so well.

1273
01:20:12,141 --> 01:20:13,350
That's what I think.

1274
01:20:13,434 --> 01:20:15,394
I really think that's why he won.

1275
01:20:16,395 --> 01:20:22,318
He beat me
because he played better than I did.

1276
01:20:22,401 --> 01:20:24,403
So, I could genuinely congratulate him.

1277
01:20:26,322 --> 01:20:31,493
Looking back, I was able to win the finals

1278
01:20:32,036 --> 01:20:35,664
because I focused on doing what I do best

1279
01:20:35,748 --> 01:20:37,750
without worrying about winning or losing.

1280
01:20:37,833 --> 01:20:40,836
And then, I got my chance at some point.

1281
01:20:41,420 --> 01:20:44,131
My best effort ended up
being my best choice.

1282
01:20:44,840 --> 01:20:48,969
[host] Here are the results of the final.
The winner of Deadly Tag is...

1283
01:20:49,553 --> 01:20:50,554
Congratulations.

1284
01:20:51,055 --> 01:20:52,556
...Horseking.

1285
01:20:52,639 --> 01:20:54,433
WINNER OF DEADLY TAG
HORSEKING

1286
01:20:54,516 --> 01:20:56,727
-[clapping]
-[Jimin] Awesome. I bet he's thrilled.

1287
01:20:57,978 --> 01:20:59,980
I had a feeling Horseking would win.

1288
01:21:00,481 --> 01:21:03,317
[triumphant yell]

1289
01:21:03,400 --> 01:21:05,819
[laughter]

1290
01:21:05,903 --> 01:21:06,904
Great job.

1291
01:21:07,946 --> 01:21:09,073
[sighs]

1292
01:21:09,656 --> 01:21:13,243
When I think about
how I ended up winning it all,

1293
01:21:13,327 --> 01:21:14,953
I still can't believe it.

1294
01:21:19,291 --> 01:21:21,126
It still doesn't feel real.

1295
01:21:21,210 --> 01:21:23,504
I don't even know how it happened.

1296
01:21:23,587 --> 01:21:28,133
Starting from "Cops and Robbers,"
we were constantly running,

1297
01:21:28,217 --> 01:21:30,469
getting messy,
and physically battling each other.

1298
01:21:31,303 --> 01:21:32,388
I'm dying.

1299
01:21:33,639 --> 01:21:36,392
It was so hard.
I seriously thought I was going to die.

1300
01:21:37,559 --> 01:21:40,813
It was beyond brutal. It was ridiculous.

1301
01:21:40,896 --> 01:21:43,482
I almost literally died.

1302
01:21:44,858 --> 01:21:48,320
[Sanghyun] Deadly Tag is the toughest show

1303
01:21:48,404 --> 01:21:49,947
I've ever been on.

1304
01:21:50,030 --> 01:21:53,992
[both panting]

1305
01:21:54,910 --> 01:21:57,037
[Jaegyun] If there's a Deadly Tag
Season 2, I'll tell people

1306
01:21:57,121 --> 01:22:00,374
"Don't sign up unless you know
your lungs can handle it."

1307
01:22:02,292 --> 01:22:03,794
[Dail] God damn it!

1308
01:22:04,586 --> 01:22:07,089
Stop it.

1309
01:22:07,840 --> 01:22:08,966
[screams]

1310
01:22:09,049 --> 01:22:14,054
It was such a grueling,
exhausting experience.

1311
01:22:15,597 --> 01:22:18,559
But at the same time, I really loved it.

1312
01:22:19,101 --> 01:22:23,063
It felt like I'd become a kid again.

1313
01:22:23,147 --> 01:22:27,276
Just like kids, we were playing tag
and hide-and-seek.

1314
01:22:27,734 --> 01:22:31,196
[panting and laughing]

1315
01:22:31,280 --> 01:22:34,366
We were laughing like crazy
while running and chasing each other.

1316
01:22:35,492 --> 01:22:37,661
I found myself genuinely enjoying it.

1317
01:22:38,245 --> 01:22:41,915
[Jimin] It was such a special
and refreshing experience,

1318
01:22:41,999 --> 01:22:45,627
and I think this show reminded me
how much fun games can actually be.

1319
01:22:45,711 --> 01:22:49,173
[Dail] Going to the most basic level,
we became friends with new people

1320
01:22:49,256 --> 01:22:51,675
and made memories
while playing games together.

1321
01:22:51,758 --> 01:22:56,930
[Jaegyun] It was brutally hard,
but it was also so much fun.

1322
01:22:58,098 --> 01:23:02,394
It really felt like we were
the only people in the whole world.

1323
01:23:02,478 --> 01:23:05,397
It was as if just us players
were on a deserted island.

1324
01:23:05,481 --> 01:23:08,275
I grew really attached to everyone.

1325
01:23:09,818 --> 01:23:12,070
-You did amazing.
-Great work.

1326
01:23:12,154 --> 01:23:13,155
[Jaegyun] Congratulations.

1327
01:23:13,864 --> 01:23:15,115
-[Jimin] Congratulations.
-Thank you.

1328
01:23:15,199 --> 01:23:16,533
[Sanghyun laughs]

1329
01:23:18,035 --> 01:23:20,370
Hey, you did amazing.

1330
01:23:20,454 --> 01:23:23,665
If I hadn't gotten hurt,
I could've won. I'm bummed.

1331
01:23:23,749 --> 01:23:26,668
I'm going to work out more
once I get back home. [chuckles]

1332
01:23:26,752 --> 01:23:29,922
[Jimin] This has become
a bit of a bucket list item for me.

1333
01:23:30,005 --> 01:23:32,674
Winning a reality survival show
is now on my bucket list.

1334
01:23:32,758 --> 01:23:33,967
[cheering]

1335
01:23:34,051 --> 01:23:35,177
I'm getting emotional.

1336
01:23:36,220 --> 01:23:37,804
Gosh, thank you.

1337
01:23:37,888 --> 01:23:38,889
Thanks.

1338
01:23:39,723 --> 01:23:41,892
I used to be a fitness YouTuber,

1339
01:23:42,809 --> 01:23:45,729
and my subscribers were always telling me,

1340
01:23:45,812 --> 01:23:47,773
"Horseking will win
if he makes it to the end."

1341
01:23:47,856 --> 01:23:51,860
Even when I failed or messed up,
they always sent me messages of support.

1342
01:23:51,944 --> 01:23:54,655
I made it all the way to the end,
and I actually won.

1343
01:23:55,280 --> 01:23:56,990
Imagine how happy they'll be.

1344
01:23:57,074 --> 01:23:59,576
Of course, I'm glad that I won,

1345
01:23:59,660 --> 01:24:04,998
but I get even more joy
from making other people feel happy.

1346
01:24:05,916 --> 01:24:08,877
I met great people,
had an amazing experience,

1347
01:24:08,961 --> 01:24:10,796
and put up a good performance in the game.

1348
01:24:11,380 --> 01:24:14,550
I'm probably the happiest person
here right now.

1349
01:24:15,217 --> 01:24:16,468
This was so much fun.

1350
01:24:17,094 --> 01:24:18,303
Seriously,

1351
01:24:19,471 --> 01:24:20,931
I had an amazing time.

1352
01:24:25,102 --> 01:24:28,605
[laughter]

1353
01:24:28,689 --> 01:24:30,524
-[Jaegyun] Good work, everyone.
-[Dail] You all did amazing.

1354
01:24:30,607 --> 01:24:33,360
-[Horseking] Thank you.
-[Dail] Well done.

1355
01:24:33,443 --> 01:24:36,071
[Dail] The long journey
has come to an end.

1356
01:24:38,657 --> 01:24:41,076
[Jimin] It's all about luck

1357
01:24:41,159 --> 01:24:42,578
-and fate.
-Right.

1358
01:24:42,661 --> 01:24:43,662
-How fun.
-That's right.

1359
01:24:43,745 --> 01:24:46,248
[distorted voice laughs wickedly]
This time, I'll take everyone out.

1360
01:24:46,582 --> 01:24:48,542
[♪ ominous music playing]

1361
01:24:48,625 --> 01:24:50,043
[host] Now,

1362
01:24:51,336 --> 01:24:53,422
we will select a new Seeker.

1363
01:24:58,385 --> 01:25:00,095
[distorted voice] Catch me if you can.

1364
01:25:00,178 --> 01:25:03,181
[♪ lively music playing]

1365
01:25:22,117 --> 01:25:24,119
Translated by Youji Kim
